    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1001
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mortal Blow[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Strike down the enemy with a greatsword and have chance to inflict Burn status effect. The target enemy will be knocked up.\n(Can be actived in midair)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Смертельный удар[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Поразить врага двуручным мечом. Есть вероятность наложить статус Горение. Цель будет подброшена вверх.\n(Может быть активирован в воздухе)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Golpe Mortal[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Derrube o inimigo com uma grande espada e tenha uma oportunidade de infligir o efeito provocado pelo estado de Queimadura. O inimigo-alvo será eliminado.\n(Pode ser ativado em pleno ar)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Đòn Quyết Định[-] \n[BDB9B6FF] Dùng kiếm đâm mạnh xuống, có khả năng thiêu đốt kẻ địch. Mục tiêu sẽ bị đánh văng lên trời.\n(Có thể kích hoạt trên không)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Tödlichen Schlag[-] \n[BDB9B6FF] Schlagen Sie den Feind mit einem Zweihänder und haben Wahrscheinlichkeit Brennen Status Effekt zu verursachen. Der Feind wird oben geklopft werden.\n(Kann in der Luft aktiviert sein)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Golpe mortal [-] \n[BDB9B6FF] Golpea al enemigo con una gran espada y tienes la oportunidad de infligir un efecto de estado quemado. El enemigo objetivo será derribado."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Coup mortel[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Frapper l’ennemi avec une grande épée et avoir la chance d’infliger l'effet de statut de brûlure. L'ennemi ciblé sera assommé.\n(Peut être activé dans les airs)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Scoppio Mortale[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Butta al tappeto il nemico con uno spadone e ottieni la possibilità diinfliggere un effetto status Burn. Il nemico bersaglio sarà messo al tappeto. (Può essere attivata a mezz'aria)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]モータルブロー[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]偉大なる剣で敵を撃墜し、火傷効果を与える。ターゲットの敵は打ち上げられる。（空中で起動可能)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ระเบิดมหันตภัย[-] \n\n[BDB9B6FF]ล้มโจมตีศัตรูด้วยดาบอันยิ่งใหญ่และมีโอกาส \nก่อให้เกิดสถานะเผาไหม้ เป้าหมายจะถูกน็อค \n(ใช้งานกลางอากาศได้)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Pukulan Mematikan[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Menyerang musuh dengan pedang besar dan memiliki peluang untuk memberikan efek status Terbakar. Musuh target akan terbanting.\n(Dapat diaktifkan di udara)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]모탈 블로우[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]검으로 적을 내리쳐 대상을 넘어뜨립니다.\n(공중에서 사용 가능)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mortal Blow[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Atakihin ang kalaban gamit ang espada at magkaroon ng pagkakataong makapagbigay ng Nasusunog na epekto. Ang target na kalaban ay babagsak.\n(Maaaring i-activate habang naglalaban)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]致命一击[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]用一把巨剑击倒敌人时有机会产生灼伤状态效果。目标敌人将被击倒。\n（可在半空中发动）"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]致命一擊[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]用一把巨劍擊倒敵人時有機會產生灼傷狀態效果。目標敵人將被擊倒。\n（可在半空中發動）"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1002
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Blighted Force[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Max focuses power on his demonic arm, dealing lethal blows of magical damage effortlessly and have a chance to apply Super Attack."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Сокрушающая сила[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Макс фокусирует сверхъестественную силу в своей руке, причиняя смертельные повреждения магической атакой. Есть вероятность активировать Супер атаку."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Força Arruinada[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Max concentra a força no seu braço demoníaco, facilmente instigando golpes letais de danos mágicos e abrindo uma oportunidade de aplicar o Super Ataque."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Lời Nguyền Của Quỷ[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Max tập trung sức mạnh vào cánh tay ma quỷ của mình, dễ dàng tạo ra những cú đánh chết người gây sát thương phép thuật và có khả năng siêu tấn công"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Verdorben Kraft [-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Max konzentriert sich auf seine dämonische arm, Umgang tödliche Schläge von magischen Schaden mühelos und haben eine Wahrscheinlichkeit, Super Angriff erhoben."
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Fuerza Marchita [-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF] Max concentra el poder en su brazo demoníaco, aplica golpes letales de daño mágico sin esfuerzo y tiene la oportunidad de aplicar Super Ataque."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Force Blafarde[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Max concentre la puissance sur son bras démoniaque, infligeant des coups mortels de dégâts magiques sans effort et ayant une chance d'appliquer Super Attack."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Forza Distruttiva[-] \n\n[BDB9B6FF]Max si concentra sul suo braccio demoniaco, dando colpi letali di danno magico senza tregua e una chance di applicare un Super Attacco."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ブライトフォース[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]マックスは悪魔の腕に力を集中させ、魔法のダメージの致命的な爆破で、スーパーアタックの命中率を上げる。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]พลังทำลายล้าง[-]\n\n[BDB9B6FF]แม็กซ์จะเน้นการใช้พลังจากแขนปีศาจ ทำให้สร้างเวทย์ดาเมจได้อย่างง่ายดายและเพิ่มโอกาสในการใช้การโจมตีสุดยอด"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Kekuatan Perusak[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Max memfokuskan kekuatan di lengan iblisnya, memberikan pukulan mematikan dengan damage sihir dan memiliki peluang untuk memberikan Serangan Super."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]블라이트 포스[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]맥스가 악마의 팔이 가진 힘을 살짝 \n개방하여 강력한 마법 피해를 입힙니다. \n일정 확률로 슈퍼 어택을 합니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Blighted Force[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Itutuon ni Max ang kapangyarihan sa kanyang malademonyong braso, na nagbibigay ng nakamamatay na atake at mahiwagang pinsala ng walang hirap at may pagkakataong magamit ang Super Attack."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]毁灭之力[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]马克斯将力量集中于他有魔力的手臂上，毫不费力地对敌人造成致命的魔法伤害攻击，并一定几率打出超能攻击。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]毀滅之力[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]馬克斯將力量集中於他有魔力的手臂上，毫不費力地對敵人造成致命的魔法傷害攻擊，並一定幾率打出超能攻擊。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1003
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Rolling Smash[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Max does a 360 degree whirlwind spin with his sword forward before slowing down to a halt and can possibly break the enemies' armor."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Круговой удар[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Макс делает полный оборот вокруг себя с мечем в руках. Есть вероятность разбить вражеские доспехи."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Golpe Rotativo[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Max faz um redemoinho de 360 ​​graus com a espada antes de desacelerar até parar, podendo quebrar a armadura dos inimigos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Công Kích Vũ Bão[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Max cùng với thanh kiếm của mình xoay vòng 360 độ trước khi chậm lại và có khăng năng xuyên giáp"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Rollen Smash [-] \n [BDB9B6FF] Max hat eine 360-Wirbelwind drehen mit seinem Schwert vor Bremsen zum Stillstand und kann möglicherweise Rüstung die Feinde \"Pause\"."
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Rodado Aplastante [-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF] Max hace un giro de 360 grados con su espada hacia adelante antes de frenar hasta detenerse y posiblemente rompe la armadura de los enemigos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Coup roulant[-] \n  [BDB9B6FF] Max fait un tourbillon de 360 ​​degrés avec son épée vers l'avant avant de ralentir jusqu'à l'arrêt et peut éventuellement casser l'armure des ennemis."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Colpo Rotante[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Max compie una rotazione di 360° con la spada in avanti prima di rallentare e fermarsi, con la possibilità di rompere l'armatura dei nemici."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ローリングスマッシュ[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]マックスは360度の旋風スピンを行い、剣を前方に倒して停止し、敵の鎧を壊す可能性がある。[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]โจมตีด้วยการหมุน[-]\n\n[BDB9B6FF]แม็กซ์จะหมุน 360 องศาพร้อมถือดาบไปข้างหน้า แล้วค่อย ๆ ลดความเร็วและหยุดการเคลื่อนไหวลงจนสามารถทำลายเกราะของศัตรูได้"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Serangan Berguling[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Max melakukan putaran angin 360 derajat dengan pedangnya ke depan sebelum melambat dan dapat menghancurkan armor musuh."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]롤링 스매시[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]맥스가 360도 회전하며 전방으로 \n이동하여 검으로 적을 베어버립니다. \n일정 확률로 적의 방어구를 파괴합니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Rolling Smash[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Si Max ay pasulong na iikot ng napakabilis na 360 degree kasama ang kanyang espada bago bumagal hanggang sa huminto at maaaring mabasag ang baluti ng kalaban."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]旋转重击[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]马克斯用剑向前快速旋转360度，然后减速至停止。这个招式可能会击破敌人的防具。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]旋轉重擊[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]馬克斯用劍向前快速旋轉360度，然後減速至停止。這個招式可能會擊破敵人的防具。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1004
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sky Uppercut[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Pierces the enemy then perform a sky uppercut, leaving a trail of exploding energy. Has a chance to cut through target's armor.\n (Can be activated in midair)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Высокий вал[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Пронзает врага, после чего выполняет высокий апперкот, оставляя за собой энергетический след. Есть вероятность нанести удар, минуя вражеские доспехи.\n(Может быть активирован в воздухе)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Grande Apostador[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Perfura o inimigo, depois executa um gancho do céu, deixando um rasto explosivo de energia. Tem a hipótese de cortar a armadura do alvo. (Pode ser ativado no ar)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phá Thiên[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Đâm kẻ địch sau đó thực hiện một cú chém lên phía trên, để lại một dấu vết của sự bùng nổ năng lượng. Có khả năng chém xuyên qua áo giáp của kẻ địch.\n(Có thể kích hoạt trên không)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] High Roller [-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Durchbohrt den Feind dann eine Himmelhieb durchführen, lässt eine Spur von explodierenden Energie. Hat eine Wahrscheinlichkeit durch die Rüstung zu schneiden.\n (Kann in der Luft aktiviert werden)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Apostador Alto [-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF] Atraviesa al enemigo y luego realiza un gancho en el cielo, dejando un rastro de energía explotada. Tiene la oportunidad de atravesar la armadura del objetivo. (Se puede activar en el aire)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]High Roller[-] \n  [BDB9B6FF]Perce l’ennemi puis effectue un uppercut du ciel, laissant une traînée d’énergie qui explose. A une chance de couper à travers l’armure de la cible.\n  (Peut être activé dans les airs)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Rotazione Alta[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Perfora il nemico, poi effettua un montante al cielo, lasciando una traccia di energia esplosiva. Ha una possibilità di perforare l'armatura del bersaglio. (Può essere attivata a mezz'aria."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ハイローラー[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]敵を撃破してスカイアッパーカットを行い、爆発した痕跡を残す。ターゲットの鎧を切り刻むこともある。 （空中で起動可能）"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ม้วนตัวในที่สูง[-]\n\n[BDB9B6FF]ห้ำหั่นศัตรูแล้วปล่อยหมัดสอยดาวกลางอากาศทำให้เกิดพลังงานของการระเบิด เพิ่มโอกาสในการเจาะผ่านเกราะของเป้าหมายได้\n(ใช้งานกลางอากาศได้)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Rol Tinggi[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Menusuk musuh lalu melakukan uppercut di langit, meninggalkan jejak energi yang meledak. Memiliki peluang untuk memotong menembus armor musuh.\n (Dapat diaktifkan di udara)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]스카이 어퍼컷[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]검으로 적을 뚫고 공중으로 도약하며 올려벱니다. \n검의 궤도에 폭발하는 에너지가 남습니다. \n일정 확률로 대상의 방어구를 관통합니다.\n(공중에서 사용 가능)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]High Roller[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Tutusukin ang kalaban pagkatapos ay magsasagawa ng sky uppercut, na nag-iiwan ng bakas ng sumasabog na enerhiya. Mayroong pagkakataon na mahiwa ang baluti ng kalaban.\n (Maaaring i-activate habang naglalaban)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]升天上钩拳[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]用剑穿透敌人，然后打出一记升天上钩拳，留下一道能量爆炸的轨迹。有一定几率穿透目标的防具。\n（可在半空中发动）"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]升天上鉤拳[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]用劍穿透敵人，然後打出一記升天上鉤拳，留下一道能量爆炸的軌跡。有一定幾率穿透目標的防具。\n（可在半空中發動）"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1005
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Whirlwind[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Delivers multiple attacks to nearby enemies by swinging his sword repeatedly, dragging enemies toward him. Movement is enabled during skill execution. May grant Super Armor.\n (Can be activated in midair)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Вихрь[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Наносит многочисленные повреждения находящимся рядом врагам, притягивая их к себе. Во время применения этого умения невозможно двигаться. Есть вероятность получить Супер доспех.\n (Может быть активирован в воздухе)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Redemoinho[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Faz vários ataques a inimigos próximos usando a sua espada repetidamente, arrastando inimigos na sua direção. O movimento é ativado durante a execução da capacidade. Poderá obter a Super Armadura. (Pode ser ativado no ar)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Lốc Xoáy[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Max vung kiếm liên tục gây sát thương và kéo kẻ địch lại gần. Có thể di chuyển trong khi thi triển kỹ năng. Có thể kích hoạt Siêu Giáp cho mình\n(Có thể kích hoạt trên không)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Wirbelwind [-] \n [BDB9B6FF] liefert mehrere Angriffe auf Feinde in der Nähe durch sein Schwert schwingen, Gegner ziehen immer wieder auf ihn zu. Bewegung wird während der Fähigkeit Durchführung aktiviert. Gewähren kann. Super Rüstung.\n (Kann in der Luft aktiviert werden)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Torbellino [-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF] Da múltiples ataques a los enemigos cercanos moviendo tu espada repetidamente, arrastrando enemigos hacia él. El movimiento se habilita durante la ejecución de habilidades. Puede otorgar Super Armadura.\n  (Se puede activar en el aire)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Tourbillon[-] \n  [BDB9B6FF]Délivre des attaques multiples aux ennemis proches en balançant son épée à plusieurs reprises, faisant glisser les ennemis vers lui. Mouvement est activé pendant l’exécution de compétences. Peut accorder Super armure.\n  (Peut être activé dans les airs)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Tromba d'aria[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Infligge attacchi multipli ai nemici vicini roteando la sua spada ripetutamente, trascinando a sé I nemici. Il movimento è abilitato durante l'esecuzione di abilità. Può far conquistare la Super Armatura. (Può essere attivata a mezz'aria)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ワールウインド[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]剣を複数回振り、近接している敵に攻撃する。また、敵を引き寄せる効果もある。スキルの実行中も移動でき、スーパーアーマーを付与することもある。 \n（空中で起動可能）"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ลมกรด[-]\n \n [BDB9B6FF]โจมตีศัตรูจำนวนมากในบริเวณใกล้เคียงด้วยการกวัดแกว่งดาบอย่างต่อเนื่องและลากศัตรูมาด้านหน้า สามารถเคลื่อนไหวได้ระหว่างการใช้งานสกิล อาจใช้งานเกราะสุดยอดได้\n(สามารถใช้งานกลางอากาศได้)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Angin Puyuh[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Memberikan beberapa serangan ke musuh di sekitar dengan mengayunkan pedangnya berkali-kali, menarik musuh ke dekatnya. Dapat bergerak selama eksekusi skill. Dapat memberikan Armor Super.\n (Bisa diaktifkan di udara)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]훨윈드[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]검을 연속적으로 휘둘러 주변의 적을 여러 번 공격하며 자신에게로 끌어당깁니다. \n스킬 사용 중 이동이 가능합니다.\n슈퍼 아머가 적용될 수 있습니다.\n(공중에서 사용 가능)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Whirlwind[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Nagbibigay ng maraming atake sa malalapit na kalaban sa pagwasiwas ng espada ng paulit-ulit, at humihila sa mga kalaban papalapit sa kanya. Ang pagkilos ay magagamit habang isinasagawa ang kakayahan. Maaaring makapagbigay ng Super Armor.\n (Maaaring i-activate habang naglalaban)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]旋风[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]反复挥剑，将敌人拖向身边，然后对周围的敌人进行多次攻击。在技能生效期间可以启用移动功能。可能附加超能防具效果。\n（可在半空中发动）"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]旋風[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]反復揮劍，將敵人拖向身邊，然後對周圍的敵人進行多次攻擊。在技能生效期間可以啟用移動功能。可能附加超能防具效果。\n（可在半空中發動）"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1006
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Descending Blades[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Sends forward 3 summoned demonic swords which impale the enemies and release a burst of dark energy. Has a chance to apply Super Attack."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Спускающиеся клинки[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Вызывает три сверхъестественных меча, которые пронзают врагов и вызывают взрыв тёмной энергии. Есть вероятность применения способности Супер крит."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Lâminas Descendentes[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Lança 3 espadas demoníacas invocadas, que empalam os inimigos e liberam uma explosão de energia negra. Possui a hipótese de aplicar o Super Crítico."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thần Kiếm Giáng Thế[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Max triệu hồi 3 thanh gươm quỷ đâm xuống phía trước, giúp bùng nổ năng lượng hắc ám và đánh bại kẻ địch. Có khả năng tăng chí mạng cho bản thân"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Absteigende Klingen[-] \n [BDB9B6FF] sendet vor 3 dämonischen Schwerter, die den Gegner aufspießen gerufen und ein Platzen der Dunklen Energie zu lösen. Eine Wahrscheinlichkeit hat zu Super Krit erhoben."
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Hojas descendentes [-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF] Envía 3 espadas demoníacas invocadas que empalan a los enemigos y liberan una ráfaga de energía oscura. Tiene la oportunidad de aplicar Super Crítica."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Descendre des lames[-] \n  [BDB9B6FF]Envoie 3 épées démoniaques invoquées qui empalent les ennemis et libèrent une explosion d'énergie noire. A une chance d’appliquer Super Crit."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Lame Discendenti[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Manda avanti 3 spade demoniace riunite che impalano I nemici e rilasciano un'esplosione di energia oscura. Ha una chance di applicare Super Critico."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ディセンドブレード[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]前方に3個の召喚された悪魔の剣を送り、敵を撃退し、暗黒のエネルギーの爆発を放つ。スーパークリティカルのチャンスあり。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ดาบจากบรรพบุรุษ[-]\n\n[BDB9B6FF]โจมตีด้วยดาบปีศาจ 3 เล่มซึ่งจะทิ่มแทงศัตรูและปล่อยระเบิดพลังงานจากความมืด มีโอกาสใช้คริติคอลสุดยอด"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Pisau Jatuh[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Mengirimkan 3 pedang iblis yang menusuk musuh dan melepaskan energi gelap. Memiliki peluang memberikan Kritis Super."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]디센딩 블레이드[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]악마의 검 3자루를 소환하여 적을 꿰뚫고 어둠의 에너지를 폭발시킵니다. \n일정 확률로 슈퍼 어택이 적용됩니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Descending Blades[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Nagpapadala pasulong ng 3 tinawag na malademonyong espada na tumutusok sa mga kalaban at nagsasambulat ng itim na enerhiya. May pagkakataon magamit ang Super Crit."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]沉降剑锋[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]召出三把恶魔之剑并将它们劈向前方，穿透敌人的身体并释放出一股黑暗能量。有一定几率打出超能攻击。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]沉降劍鋒[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]召出三把惡魔之劍並將它們劈向前方，穿透敵人的身體並釋放出一股黑暗能量。有一定幾率打出超能攻擊。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1007
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sword Rain[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Rains down a hail of swords that deals damage on impact to all enemies in the target area."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Дождь из мечей[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Обрушивает множество мечей, наносящих удар всем врагам, находящимся в области поражения."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Chuva de Espadas[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Espadas caem do céu, causando dano aos inimigos no impacto na área de destino."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mưa Kiếm[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Giải phóng nhiều thanh kiếm tấn công tất cả kẻ thù trong khu vực bị ảnh hưởng."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Schwertregen[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Regnet einen Hagel von Schwertern hinunter, der beim Aufprall auf alle Feinde im Zielgebiet Schaden verursacht."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sword Rain[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Rains down a hail of swords that deals damage on impact to all enemies in the target area."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sword Rain[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Rains down a hail of swords that deals damage on impact to all enemies in the target area."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sword Rain[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Rains down a hail of swords that deals damage on impact to all enemies in the target area."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]剣の雨[-] [BDB9B6FF]衝突時に、対象エリア内にいるすべての敵にダメージを与える剣の雨を降らせる。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ฝนคมดาบ[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]ดาบร่วงหล่นลงมาดั่งห่าฝนเพื่อสร้างความเสียหายให้กับศัตรูทั้งหมดที่อยู่ในพื้นที่เป้าหมาย"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sword Rain[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Rains down a hail of swords that deals damage on impact to all enemies in the target area."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]검의 비[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]검이 비처럼 내려 타깃 지역 내에 있는 모든 적들에게 데미지를 입힙니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sword Rain[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Rains down a hail of swords that deals damage on impact to all enemies in the target area."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]剑雨[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]降下无数把剑，对目标区域内所有敌人造成伤害。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]劍雨[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]降下無數把劍，對目的地區域內所有敵人造成傷害。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_1_1_1008
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Demon Slash[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]One step further in controlling the demonic power, now Max can uses it to move with super speed and slash everything down just in a blink of an eye."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Дьявольский удар[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Еще один шаг в управлении дьявольской силой. Теперь Макс может использовать его, чтобы перемещаться с суперскоростью и наносить всем удары, и глазом не моргнув."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Corte Demoníaco[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Um pouco mais perto de controlar o poder demoníaco, agora Max consegue usá-lo para se mover com supervelocidade e cortar qualquer coisa em um piscar de olhos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Quỷ Trảm[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Max kiểm soát sức mạnh ma quỷ, sử dụng chúng để di chuyển với tốc độ cực nhanh và chém mọi thứ trong nháy mắt."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dämonenschnitt[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Max ist einen Schritt weiter bei der Kontrolle der dämonischen Macht und kann sie jetzt nutzen, um sich superschnell zu bewegen und im Nu alles niederzumähen."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Demon Slash[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]One step further in controlling the demonic power, now Max can uses it to move with super speed and slash everything down just in a blink of an eye."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Demon Slash[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]One step further in controlling the demonic power, now Max can uses it to move with super speed and slash everything down just in a blink of an eye."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Demon Slash[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]One step further in controlling the demonic power, now Max can uses it to move with super speed and slash everything down just in a blink of an eye."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]悪魔の斬撃[-] [BDB9B6FF]悪魔の力を制御するためにさらに一歩前進したマックスは、その力を使って超高速で動き、一瞬ですべてを斬り倒す。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]คมดาบปีศาจ[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]แม็กซ์มีความก้าวหน้าในการควบควมพลังปิศาจขึ้นไปอีกขั้น และสามารถใช้พลังปีศาจเพื่อเคลื่อนที่ไปอย่างรวดเร็วพร้อมกับฟันทุกสิ่งให้ราบคาบภายในชั่วพริบตา"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Demon Slash[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]One step further in controlling the demonic power, now Max can uses it to move with super speed and slash everything down just in a blink of an eye."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]악마의 일격[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]악마의 힘을 더욱 잘 제어할 수 있게 된 맥스는 이제 자신의 힘을 사용해서 \n엄청나게 빠른 속도로 이동하고 눈 깜짝할 새에 모든 적들을 베어버립니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Demon Slash[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]One step further in controlling the demonic power, now Max can uses it to move with super speed and slash everything down just in a blink of an eye."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]恶魔斩击[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]在控制恶魔之力方面，马克斯已更进一步。现在，他可以用恶魔之力高速移动，在眨眼间就能把所有东西都砍倒。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]惡魔斬擊[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]在控制惡魔之力方面，馬克斯已更進一步。現在，他可以用惡魔之力高速移動，在眨眼間就能把所有東西都砍倒。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1001
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Spiral Galaxy[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Launches forward a swirling phantasm in the shape of Lunae's scythe. (can be activated in mid-air).\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Спиральная галактика[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Выпускает вращающийся образ косы Лунаа (может быть активировано в воздухе).\nКоличество зарядов: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Galáxia Espiral[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lança para a frente um fantasma rodopiante com a forma da foice de Lunae. (pode ser ativado no ar).\nNúmero de cargas: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Vòng Xoay Vũ Trụ[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Phóng ra bóng ma lưỡi hái xoáy của Lunae. (Có thể kích hoạt trên không).\nSố vòng: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Spiralgalaxie[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Schickt ein wirbelndes Trugbild in Form von Lunaes Sense nach vorn (kann in der Luft aktiviert werden).\nAnzahl der Nutzungen: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Galaxia espiral[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lanza hacia adelante una aparición giratoria en la forma de la guadaña de Lunae. (Se puede activar en el aire).\nCantidad de cargas: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Galaxie spirale[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lance un phantasme tourbillonnant en forme de faux de Lunae. (peut être activé dans les airs). \nNombre de charges : [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Galassia Spirale[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lancia in avanti un fantasma rotante a forma di falce di Lunae. (Si può attivare a mezz'aria).\nNumero di Cariche: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ギャラクシースパイラル[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]月の鎌を象った渦巻く幻影を発射する（空中で作動可能）。 \n消費値：[-] [F1AD4DFF] 3 [-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]กังหันดาราจักร[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]ปลดปล่อยภาพลวงตารูปเคียวของลูน่าให้หมุนวนไปทางด้านหน้า (สามารถใช้งานกลางอากาศได้)\nจำนวนการชาร์จ: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Galaksi Spiral[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Meluncurkan ke depan ilusi berputar dalam bentuk sabit Lunae. (dapat diaktifkan di udara). Jumlah charge: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]소용돌이 성운[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]낫 모양의 소용돌이 환영을 날립니다\n(공중에서 사용 가능)\n차지 수: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Spiral Galaxy[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Sumusugod pasulong ng paikot sa hugis ng karit ni Lunae. (maaaring gamitin habang nasa hangin). Bilang ng Karga: [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]螺旋星系[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]发射出一个呈鲁娜的镰刀形状的旋转幻影（可在半空中发动）。\n装填次数： [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]螺旋星系[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]發射出一個呈魯娜的鐮刀形狀的旋轉幻影（可在半空中發動）。\n裝填次數： [-][F1AD4DFF]3[-]"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1002
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Dải ngân hà [-]\n[BDB9B6FF] Xoắn không gian tạo ra một cổng dịch chuyển cong vênh khiến Lunae luôn đi trước một khoảng cách ngắn, phục kích kẻ thù từ phía sau.\nSố lần tính phí: [-] [F1AD4DFF] 2 [-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Vía láctea[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Modifica el espacio para crear un portal que teletransporta a Lunae una distancia corta hacia adelante, lo que le permite emboscar a los enemigos por detrás.\nCantidad de cargas: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]天の川[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]時空を捻じ曲げて生み出されるワープポータル。ルナエが短い距離をワープして、敵の背後から奇襲をかける。\nチャージ数: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]밀키웨이[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]공간을 비틀어 루나를 뒤틀고, \n뒤쪽에서 적을 매복 공격하는 뒤틀리는 포탈을 만듭니다.\n차지 수: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Milky Way[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Twists the space to create a warping portal that warps Lunae a short distance ahead, ambushing enemies from behind.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1003
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Nova Dance[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Wipes out all nearby enemies with a continuous spinning storm of slashes. (can be activated in mid-air)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Танец сверхновой[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Сметает с пути всех врагов с помощью серии круговых ударов (может быть активировано в воздухе)"
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Dança Nova[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Aniquila todos os inimigos próximos com uma tempestade contínua de barras. (Pode ser ativada no ar)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Vũ Điệu Sao Mai[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae thực hiện vũ khúc tinh tú uyển chuyển nhưng chết chóc, tiêu diệt mọi kẻ địch trên đường điệu múa của cô. (Có thể kích hoạt trên không)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Novatanz[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Löscht alle Gegner in der Nähe mit einem kontinuierlichen, sich drehenden Sturm von Schlägen aus (kann in der Luft aktiviert werden)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Danza de novas[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Arrasa con todos los enemigos cercanos con una continua tormenta giratoria de hojas. (Se puede activar en el aire)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Danse Nova[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Efface tous les ennemis proches avec une tempête continue de barres obliques. (peut être activé dans les airs)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Nova Dance[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Spazza via tutti i nemici vicini con un turbinio continuo di fendenti. (si può attivare a mezz'aria)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ノヴァ・ダンス[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]周囲のすべての敵を、スラッシュの連続した激しい嵐で拭き取ります。（空中で作動可能）」"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ระบำโนวา[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]กำจัดเหล่าศัตรูที่อยู่ใกล้เคียงทั้งหมดด้วยการหมุนตัวฟาดฟันอย่างต่อเนื่อง (สามารถใช้งานกลางอากาศได้)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Tarian Nova[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Menghabisi semua musuh di sekitar dengan badai tebasan berputar terus-menerus. (dapat diaktifkan di udara)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]신성의 춤[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]계속해서 돌아가는 폭풍으로 주변의 모든 적들을 쓸어버립니다. \n(공중에서 사용 가능)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Nova Dance[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Nililipol lahat ng kalaban sa malapit gamit ang patuloy na umiikot na mga hiwa ng bagyo. (maaaring gamitin habang nasa hangin)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]新星狂舞[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]用持续旋转，宛如狂风暴雨的猛烈斩击消灭附近所有的敌人。（可在半空中发动）。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]新星狂舞[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]用持續旋轉，宛如狂風暴雨的猛烈斬擊消滅附近所有的敵人。（可在半空中發動）。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1004
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Crescent Cleaver[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Fires 4 crescent-shape shockwaves consecutively. (can be activated in mid-air)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Топор полумесяца[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Выстреливает четырьмя ударными волнами в форме полумесяца (может быть активировано в воздухе)."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Cutelo Crescente[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Dispara consecutivamente 4 ondas de choque na forma de um crescente. (pode ser ativado no ar)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Trăng Lưỡi Liềm[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Tung ra 4 bóng ma hình trăng lưỡi liềm sắc nhọn. (Có thể kích hoạt trên không)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Halbmondhäcksler[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Feuert nacheinander 4 halbmondförmige Schockwellen ab (kann in der Luft aktiviert werden)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Crescent Cleaver[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Fires 4 crescent-shape shockwaves consecutively. (can be activated in mid-air)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Fendoir du Croissant[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Tire consécutivement 4 ondes de choc en forme de croissant. (peut être activé dans les airs)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mannaia Ricurva[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Manda 4 onde d'urto consecutive a forma ricurva. (si può attivare a mezz'aria)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]クレセント・クリーバー[-] \n [BDB9B6FF] 4つの三日月形の衝撃波を連続して発射します。（空中で活性化することができる）。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]คมมีดจันทร์เสี้ยว[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ยิงคลื่นกระแทกรูปจันทร์เสี้ยวออกไป 4 ลูกติดต่อกัน (สามารถใช้งานกลางอากาศได้)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Parang Sabit[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Menembakkan 4 gelombang kejut berbentuk sabit secara berurutan. (dapat diaktifkan di udara)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]신월의 칼[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]초승달 모양의 충격파 4개를 연달아 발사합니다. (공중에서 사용 가능)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Crescent Cleaver[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Tuloy-tuloy na bumabaril ng 4 na hugis ng crescent ng shockwave. (maaaring gamitin habang nasa hangin)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]新月斩击[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]连续发射4个新月形冲击波。（可在半空中发动）"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]新月斬擊[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]連續發射4個新月形衝擊波。（可在半空中發動）"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1005
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Shooting Star[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]The stars responded to Lunae’s call, rain down from above and deal damage in its wake. (can be activated in mid-air)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Падающая звезда[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Лунаа призывает звезды, которые падают с неба и наносят урон врагам (может быть активировано в воздухе)"
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Estrela Cadente[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]As estrelas responderam à chamada de Lunae, originando chuva e danos. (pode ser ativado no ar)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mưa Sao Băng[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Các ngôi sao nghe lời gọi của Lunae từ trên trời rơi xuống xung quanh, gây sát thương diện rộng. (Có thể kích hoạt trên không)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sternschnuppe[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Die Sterne reagieren auf Lunaes Ruf, fallen von oben herab und verursachen Schaden (kann in der Luft aktiviert werden)."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Shooting Star[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]The stars responded to Lunae’s call, rain down from above and deal damage in its wake. (can be activated in mid-air)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Étoile filante[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Les étoiles ont répondu à l'appel de Lunae, elles pleuvent d'en haut et infligent des dégâts dans son sillage. (peut être activé dans les airs)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Stelle mortali[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Le stelle rispondono alla chiamata di Lunae, scendono dall'alto e infliggono danni nella loro scia. (si può attivare a mezz'aria)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]シューティングスター[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]星はルナエの呼びかけに反応し、雨を降らせ目覚めと共にダメージを与えます。（空中で作動することができる）」"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ดาวตกสังหาร[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ดวงดาวปรากฏขึ้นตามคำเรียกของลูน่า พร้อมกับร่วงหล่นลงมาจากฟากฟ้าและสร้างความเสียหายตามเส้นทางที่ผ่านไป (สามารถใช้งานกลางอากาศได้)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Bintang Jatuh[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Bintang-bintang menjawab panggilan Lunae, menghujani dari atas dan memberikan damage. (dapat diaktifkan di udara)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]유성[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]루나의 부름에 응답한 별들이 하늘에서 쏟아져 데미지를 입힙니다. \n(공중에서 사용 가능)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Shooting Star[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Ang mga bituin ay tumutugon sa tawag ni Lunae, umuulan mula sa taas at gumagawa ng pinsala sa paggising. (maaaring gamitin habang nasa hangin)"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]流星[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]星星响应了鲁娜的召唤，从天空中降落，其尾流会造成伤害。（可在半空中发动）"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]流星[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]星星回應了魯娜的召喚，從天空中降落，其尾流會造成傷害。（可在半空中發動）"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1006
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Full Moon[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Lunae lunges forward with unleashed energy of the moon, lifting and cutting enemies down gracefully."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Полнолуние[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Лунаа делает выпад вперед и с помощью энергии луны сметает врагов со своего пути."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Lua Cheia[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Lunae se joga para a frente com a energia liberta da lua, erguendo e cortando inimigos de forma graciosa."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Trăng Tròn[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae giải phóng năng lượng mặt trăng, tấn công liên tiếp vào kẻ địch."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Vollmond[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Lunae stürzt mit entfesselter Mondenergie nach vorne und hebt Gegner an und mäht sie nieder."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Full Moon[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Lunae lunges forward with unleashed energy of the moon, lifting and cutting enemies down gracefully."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Pleine lune[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae se précipite avec l'énergie déchaînée de la lune, soulevant et coupant les ennemis gracieusement."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Luna Piena[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Lunae scatta in avanti con l'energia scatenata dalla luna, alzando e tagliando i nemici con grazia."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]満月[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ルナエは、解き放た月のエネルギーで前方に突き進み敵を吊り上げ、斬る。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]จันทร์เต็มดวง[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ลูน่าพุ่งไปข้างหน้าพร้อมกับปลดปล่อยพลังของจันทรา เพื่อยกเหล่าศัตรูขึ้นแล้วฟาดฟันสังหารอย่างสง่างาม"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Bulan Purnama[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Lunae maju ke depan dengan energi bulan, mengangkat dan memotong musuh dengan anggun."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]만월[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]강력한 달의 에너지로 앞으로 돌진해 적들을 우아하게 공중에 띄워 베어버립니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Full Moon[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Si Lunae ay sumusugod pasulong na may pinakakawalang enerhiya ng buwan, inaangat at hinihiwa ang mga kaaway ng mabuti."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]满月[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]鲁娜利用月亮释放的能量向前冲刺，优雅地举起并消灭敌人。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]滿月[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]魯娜利用月亮釋放的能量向前衝刺，優雅地舉起並消滅敵人。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1007
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Doom Bloom[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae’s scythe soars into the sky and spins rapidly in the air, releasing its phantasms around itself. The phantasms, upon impact, leave a painful Cold Burn effect."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Роковое цветение[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Коса Луни взлетает в небо и быстро вращается в воздухе, выпуская призраков. Призраки при столкновении с врагом наносят болезненный эффект Обморожения."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Eflorescência da Condenação[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]A foice de Lunae eleva-se ao céu e gira rapidamente no ar, liberando fantasmas ao seu redor. Os fantasmas, com o impacto, deixam um efeito de queimadura de frio."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hoa Tử Thần[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae xoay lưỡi hái trong không trung, giải phóng sức mạnh bản thân. Cô tạo ra vô số ảo ảnh tấn công liên tiếp lên mọi kẻ địch trong vùng ảnh hưởng. Ảo ảnh gây hiệu ứng Băng Huyết lên tất cả kể địch trúng chiêu."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Blüte der Verhängnis[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunaes Sense steigt in den Himmel und dreht sich schnell in der Luft, wobei sie ihre Phantome um sich herum freisetzt. Die Phantome hinterlassen beim Aufprall einen schmerzhaften Kaltverbrennungseffekt."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Doom Bloom[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae’s scythe soars into the sky and spins rapidly in the air, releasing its phantasms around itself. The phantasms, upon impact, leave a painful Cold Burn effect."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Doom Bloom[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae’s scythe soars into the sky and spins rapidly in the air, releasing its phantasms around itself. The phantasms, upon impact, leave a painful Cold Burn effect."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Doom Bloom[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae’s scythe soars into the sky and spins rapidly in the air, releasing its phantasms around itself. The phantasms, upon impact, leave a painful Cold Burn effect."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]破滅の花[-] [BDB9B6FF]ルナエの鎌が空に舞い上がり、空中で急速に回転し、周囲に幻影を放出する。幻影は衝突時に、ダメージを伴う低温火傷の効果を残す。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]บุปผาแห่งความตาย[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]เคียวของลูน่าหมุนบินขึ้นไปบนท้องฟ้าอย่างรวดเร็ว พร้อมกับปลดปล่อยภาพลวงตาออกไปรอบ ๆ เคียว ซึ่งจะส่งผลให้ศัตรูที่โดนภาพลวงตาเข้าไปติดสถานะน้ำแข็งกัด"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Doom Bloom[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae’s scythe soars into the sky and spins rapidly in the air, releasing its phantasms around itself. The phantasms, upon impact, leave a painful Cold Burn effect."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]파멸의 꽃[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]루나의 낫이 하늘로 솟구쳐서 공중에서 올라 빠르게 회전하면서 그 주변에 환영을 \n소환합니다.\n환영은 충격을 받으면 고통스러운 동상 효과를 남깁니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Doom Bloom[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae’s scythe soars into the sky and spins rapidly in the air, releasing its phantasms around itself. The phantasms, upon impact, leave a painful Cold Burn effect."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]毁灭之花[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]鲁娜的镰刀飞上天空，在空中快速旋转，在其周围释放出幻象。这些幻象对敌人造成伤害后会产生疼痛难忍的冻伤效果。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]毀滅之花[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]魯娜的鐮刀飛上天空，在空中快速旋轉，在其周圍釋放出幻象。這些幻象對敵人造成傷害後會產生疼痛難忍的凍傷效果。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_2_1_1008
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Judgement of Keeper[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Opening the gate of space and time, Lunae prays to gain ultimate power from the eternal will of the ancient Keepers and bring judgement to those who dare break the balance of the world."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Приговор хранителя[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Открывая врата пространства и времени, Луни молится, чтобы получить совершенную силу из вечного колодца древних хранителей и вынести приговор тем, кто осмелится нарушить равновесие мира."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Julgamento do Guardião[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]No portão do tempo e espaço, Lunae implora pelo poder supremo da volição eterna dos Guardiões Milenares, para julgar todos aqueles que ousam desestabilizar o equilíbrio do mundo."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phán Quyết[-] \n[BDB9B6FF] Mở cánh cổng không gian và thời gian, Lunae cầu nguyện để nhận được sức mạnh tối thượng từ những người bảo vệ cổ đại và trừng phạt lên những kẻ dám đảo lộn sự cân bằng của thế giới."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Urteil des Hüters[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Lunae öffnet das Tor von Raum und Zeit und betet, um die ultimative Macht aus dem ewigen Willen der alten Bewahrer zu gewinnen und denen, die es wagen, das Gleichgewicht der Welt zu stören, der Gerechtigkeit zu überantworten."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Judgement of Keeper[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Opening the gate of space and time, Lunae prays to gain ultimate power from the eternal will of the ancient Keepers and bring judgement to those who dare break the balance of the world."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Judgement of Keeper[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Opening the gate of space and time, Lunae prays to gain ultimate power from the eternal will of the ancient Keepers and bring judgement to those who dare break the balance of the world."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Judgement of Keeper[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Opening the gate of space and time, Lunae prays to gain ultimate power from the eternal will of the ancient Keepers and bring judgement to those who dare break the balance of the world."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]守護者の裁き[-] [BDB9B6FF]ルナエが時空の扉を開き、その永遠の意思に祈りを捧げる。古代の守護者による究極の力を得て、世界の均衡を破る者に裁きを下す。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]การตัดสินของผู้รักษา[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]ลูน่าภาวนาเพื่อรับพลังมหาศาลจากเจตจำนงนิรันดร์ของเหล่าผู้รักษาในโบราณกาลเพื่อเปิดประตูมิติของอวกาศและเวลา และนำการพิพากษามาสู่ผู้คนที่บังอาจมาทำลายสมดุลของโลก"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Judgement of Keeper[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Opening the gate of space and time, Lunae prays to gain ultimate power from the eternal will of the ancient Keepers and bring judgement to those who dare break the balance of the world."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]수호자의 심판[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]시공간의 문이 열리자, 루나는 고대 수호자의 영원한 신령에게 궁극의 힘을 \n구하고 이 세상의 균형을 깨뜨리려고 시도하는 이들을 심판합니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Judgement of Keeper[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Opening the gate of space and time, Lunae prays to gain ultimate power from the eternal will of the ancient Keepers and bring judgement to those who dare break the balance of the world."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]守护者审判[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]鲁娜打开时空之门，并祈祷从古代守护者的永恒意志中获得终极之力，并审判那些妄想打破世界平衡的人。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]守護者審判[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]魯娜打開時空之門，並祈禱從古代守護者的永恆意志中獲得終極之力，並審判那些妄想打破世界平衡的人。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1001
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Death Spike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn slams downwards, releasing her power into the ground to unleash deadly spikes that impale her enemies from under them."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Шип смерти[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Квинн наносит удар по земле, от чего на ней появляются смертоносные шипы, поражающие врагов."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Pico da Morte[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn bate na parte inferior, liberando seu poder na terra para liberar picos mortais que empalam os seus inimigos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Gai Chết Chóc[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn triệu hồi một dải gai ma thuật, xuyên thủng kẻ địch từ dưới lòng đất."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Todesstachel[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn schlägt nach unten und gibt ihre Kraft in den Boden ab, um tödliche Stacheln zu entfesseln, die ihre Feinde aufspießen."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Púa de la muerte[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn golpea en dirección descendente y libera su poder hacia el suelo para liberar púas mortales que empalan a sus enemigos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mort transpercée[-]\n[BDB9B6FF] Quinn tape vers le bas, libérant son pouvoir dans le sol pour déchaîner des piques mortels qui empalent ses ennemis d'en dessous d'eux."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Punta della morte[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn colpisce in basso, scatenando la sua potenza a terra per rilasciare punte mortali che impalano I suoi nemici da sotto."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]デススパイク[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]クインが地面に向かって自らの力を解放し、大きな杭を発生させて敵を射抜く。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]โจมตีมรณะ[-]\n\n[BDB9B6FF]ควินน์จะโจมตีลงด้านล่างและปลดปล่อยพลังสู่พื้นเพื่อปล่อยสกิลโจมตีมรณะและทิ่มแทงศัตรูที่อยู่ข้างใต้"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Tusukan Kematian[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn membanting kebawah, melepaskan kekuatannya ke tanah untuk mengeluarkan tusukan mematikan yang menusuk musuhnya dari bawah."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]데스 스파이크[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]퀸이 땅을 강하게 내리찍으며 힘을 \n집중하여 적의 발밑에서 솟아오른 죽음의 \n칼날이 범위 내 모든 적을 꿰뚫습니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Death Spike[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Malakas na hahampas si Quinn pababa, at ilalabas ang kanyang kapangyarihan sa lupa upang maglabas ng nakamamatay na spike na tutusok sa kanyang mga kalaban mula sa kanilang ilalim."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]死亡尖钉[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]奎恩向下猛击，将她的力量灌注到地面上，释放出致命的尖刺，从敌人的脚底刺穿他们的身体。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]死亡尖釘[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]奎恩向下猛擊，將她的力量灌注到地面上，釋放出致命的尖刺，從敵人的腳底刺穿他們的身體。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1002
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dark Judgment[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Channels the void to call upon dark spheres above Quinn, laying waste to everything around and below them."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Темный приговор[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Вызывает темные сферы, уничтожающие все вокруг Квинн."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Julgamento Obscuro[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Invoca o vazio para agregar as negras esferas sobre Quinn, destruindo tudo em volta e por baixo delas."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phán Quyết Hắc Ám[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Tập trung sức mạnh để mở cánh cổng hư không, gọi ra các quả cầu ma trên không, giáng ma thuật đen xuống đầu kẻ địch của Quinn."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dunkles Urteil[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Kanalisiert die Leere, um dunkle Kugeln über Quinn herbeizurufen und alles um sie und unter ihr zu zerstören."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Juicio oscuro[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Canaliza el vacío para invocar oscuras esferas sobre Quinn, que devastan todo a su alrededor y debajo de ellas."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Jugement sombre[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Canalise le vide pour appeler les sphères sombres au-dessus de Quinn, détruisant tout ce qui se trouve autour et au-dessous."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giudizio Oscuro[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Incanala il vuoto su sfere oscure sopra Quinn, che distribuiscono scorie tutto intorno e sotto di loro."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ダークジャッジメント[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]クインの上に空隙を流し暗い球を呼び出す、その周りと下のすべてに衝撃を与える。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]คำพิพากษามืด[-]\n\n[BDB9B6FF]ใช้ที่ว่างเพื่อเรียกวงกลมดำมืดเหนือตัวควินน์ ทุกสิ่งที่อยู่ใต้มันจะถูกทำลาย"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Penghakiman Kegelapan[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Menghubungkan kekosongan untuk memanggil bola kegelapan diatas Quinn, menghancurkan semua di sekitar dan dibawahnya."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]다크 저지먼트[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]공허로부터 어둠의 구를 소환하여 \n아래에 있는 모든 것을 초토화합니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dark Judgment[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Pinapaagos ang void upang tumawag ng dark sphere sa itaas ni Quinn, na pumupuksa sa lahat ng bagay sa paligid at sa ibaba ng mga ito."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]黑暗审判[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]奎因从虚空中召唤一些黑色球体，这些球体会悬浮在奎因头顶上，向它们周围和下方的一切释放出毒素。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]黑暗審判[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]奎因從虛空中召喚一些黑色球體，這些球體會懸浮在奎因頭頂上，向它們周圍和下方的一切釋放出毒素。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1003
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Cú đánh Phobos [-]\n[BDB9B6FF] Đưa Phobo về phía trước theo hàng ngang như một mũi khoan, gây sát thương lên bất kỳ ai ở phía trước.\nSố lần tính phí: [-] [F1AD4DFF] 2 [-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Ataque de Fobos [-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Envía a Fobos hacia adelante, como en un taladro, para causar daño a cualquiera que esté enfrente.\nCantidad de cargas: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]フォボス・ストライク[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]フォボスがドリルのように一直線に前進し、立ち塞がるもの全てにダメージを与える。\nチャージ数: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]포보스 스트라이크[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]포보스를 드릴처럼 일렬로 앞으로 보내서 \n앞에 있는 모든 사람에게 피해를 입힙니다\n충전 횟수: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Phobos Strike[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sends Phobos forward in a line like a drill, inflicting damage upon anyone in front.\nNumber of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
