    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1004
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]地獄ゲート[-] \n  [BDB9B6FF]次元ポータルを開くことで、クインが短い距離をテレポートできる。2秒後にポータルは爆発し、一定範囲内にいる全ての敵にダメージを与える。\nチャージ数: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]헬게이트[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]퀸 자신을 가까운 전방으로 텔레포트하는 차원 포털을 엽니다. \n그런 다음 포털이 폭발하여 2초 후에 이어지는 폭발 반경 내 적에게 피해를 입힙니다.\n충전 횟수: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hell Gate[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Opens up a dimension portal, teleporting Quinn a short distance ahead. The portal then explodes, dealing damage to enemies in the blast radius that ensues after 2 seconds.\n Number of Charges: [-][F1AD4DFF]2[-]"
