    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1005
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dark Luminous[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Summons 3 small dark spheres and blasts them forward. The spheres remain for the duration of 5 seconds and do continuous damage."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Темное свечение[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Призывает 3 небольших темных сферы и выстреливает ими вперед. Сферы продолжают наносить врагам урон в течение 5 секунд."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Luminosidade Obsucra[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Reúna 3 pequenas esferas escuras e faça com que elas sejam detonadas à sua frente. As esferas permanecem durante 5 segundos e provocam danos contínuos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Vùng Sáng Tối[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn tích tụ năng lượng đen khủng khiếp vào 3 quả cầu bóng tối và ném chúng về phía trước. Những quả cầu tồn tại trong 5 giây và gây sát thương liên tiếp."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dunkles Leuchten[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Beschwört 3 kleine dunkle Kugeln und schießt sie nach vorn. Die Kugeln verbleiben für die Dauer von 5 Sekunden und verursachen ständigen Schaden."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dark Luminous[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Summons 3 small dark spheres and blasts them forward. The spheres remain for the duration of 5 seconds and do continuous damage."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Sombre Lumineux[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Invoque 3 petites sphères sombres et les envoie vers l’avant. Les sphères restent pendant 5 secondes et font des dégâts continus."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Luci oscure[-]\n  [BDB9B6FF]Raccoglie 3 piccole sfere scure e le scaglia in avanti. Le sfere rimangono per la durata di 5 secondi e fanno danni continui."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ダークルミナス[-] \n [BDB9B6FF] 3個の小さな黒球を召喚し、前方に吹き飛ばします。球は5秒間続き、継続的なダメージを与えます。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ความมืดโชติช่วง[-]\n\n[BDB9B6FF]เรียกวงกลมดำมืดขนาดเล็ก 3 วงและระเบิดมันออกไปข้างหน้า วงกลมนั้นจะคงอยู่เป็นเวลา 5 วินาทีและสร้างดาเมจอย่างต่อเนื่อง"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Cahaya Kegelapan[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Memanggil 3 bola kegelapan kecil dan meledakkannya ke depan. Bola akan bertahan selama 5 detik dan terus memberikan damage."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]다크 루미너스[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]어둠의 구체를 3개 소환하여 전방으로 폭발시킵니다. \n구체는 5초간 지속 피해를 줍니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Dark Luminous[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Tumatawag ng 3 maliliit na dark sphere at pinapasabog sila paharap. Ang mga sphere ay mananatili sa loob ng 5 segundo at gumagawa ng patuloy na pinsala."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]暗黑幽光[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]召唤出3个小黑球并让它们在前方爆炸。这些球体将保留5秒的时间，并产生持续性的伤害。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]暗黑幽光[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]召喚出3個小黑球並讓它們在前方爆炸。這些球體將保留5秒的時間，並產生持續性的傷害。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1006
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Eclipse[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Conjures a huge sphere full of dark energy, drawing enemies towards its center and inflicting damage within 5 seconds."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Затмение[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Вызывает большую сферу темной энергии. Враги притягиваются к ее центру и получают повреждения в течение 5 секунд."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Eclipse[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Convoca uma grande esfera repleta de energia escura, arrastando os inimigos para o epicentro e infligindo danos em 5 segundos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Nhật Thực[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Conjures a huge sphere full of dark energy, drawing enemies towards its center and inflicting damage within 5 seconds."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Finsternis[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Beschwört eine riesige Kugel voll dunkler Energie, die Gegner in Richtung Zentrum zieht und innerhalb von 5 Sekunden Schaden verursacht."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Eclipse[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Conjures a huge sphere full of dark energy, drawing enemies towards its center and inflicting damage within 5 seconds."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Eclipse[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Invoque une énorme sphère remplie d'énergie sombre, attirant les ennemis vers son centre et infligeant des dégâts pendant 5 secondes."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Eclissi[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Convoglia una enorme sfera puena di energia oscura che trascina I nemici verso il suo centro e infligge danni per 5 secondi."
      - "[F2CB7EFF] エクリプス[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ダークエネルギーでいっぱいの巨大な球を作り、中心の敵に向けて5秒以内にダメージを与える。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]อุปราคา[-]\n \n [BDB9B6FF]สร้างวงกลมขนาดใหญ่ที่เป็นไปด้วยพลังงานมืด ลากศัตรูเข้าไปยังจุดศูนย์กลางและสร้างดาเมจภายใน 5 วินาทีสร้างวงกลมขนาดใหญ่ที่เป็นไปด้วยพลังงานมืด ลากศัตรูเข้าไปยังจุดศูนย์กลางและสร้างดาเมจภายใน 5 วินาที"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Gerhana[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Membuat bola besar penuh energi kegelapan, menarik musuh kearahnya dan memberikan damage dalam 5 detik."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]이클립스[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]어둠 에너지로 가득한 거대 구체를 조종하여 적들을 끌어당기고 5초 \n내에 피해를 줍니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Eclipse[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Tumatawag ng malaking sphere na puno ng itim na enerhiya, na humihila sa mga kalaban sa gitna nito at lumilikha ng pinsala sa loob ng 5 segundo."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]日蚀[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]召唤一个充满黑暗能量的巨大球体，将敌人吸引到其中心，并在5秒内造成伤害。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]日蝕[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]召喚一個充滿黑暗能量的巨大球體，將敵人吸引到其中心，並在5秒內造成傷害。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1007
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Black Tempest[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn unleases a murder of crows flying wildly around her, dealing damage to enemies stuck in the storm."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Черная буря[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Квин выпускает стаю ворон, которые быстро летают вокруг нее, нанося урон врагам, попавшим в бурю."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Tempestade Negra[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn libera corvos que voam ao seu redor, causando dano aos inimigos presos na tempestade."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Bão Quạ[-]\n  [BDB9B6FF]Quinn giải phóng một đàn quạ, chúng lướt qua như bão tố, gây sát thương cho kẻ thù xung quanh."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Schwarzer Sturm[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn entfesselt einen Krähenschwarm, der wild um sie herum fliegt und Feinden, die im Sturm feststecken, Schaden zufügen."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Black Tempest[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn unleases a murder of crows flying wildly around her, dealing damage to enemies stuck in the storm."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Black Tempest[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn unleases a murder of crows flying wildly around her, dealing damage to enemies stuck in the storm."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Black Tempest[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn unleases a murder of crows flying wildly around her, dealing damage to enemies stuck in the storm."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]黒い嵐[-] [BDB9B6FF]クインは彼女の周りを乱暴に飛び回るカラスの群れを解き放ち、嵐の中、身動きの取れない敵にダメージを与える。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]พายุทมิฬ[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ควินน์ปลดปล่อยฝูงอีกาสังหารที่จะบินรอบตัวเธออย่างบ้าคลั่ง พร้อมกับสร้างความเสียหายให้กับเหล่าศัตรูที่อยู่ในพายุ"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Black Tempest[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn unleases a murder of crows flying wildly around her, dealing damage to enemies stuck in the storm."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]검은 폭풍[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]퀸이 주변을 난폭하게 날아다니는 까마귀 떼를 소환해서 폭풍 안에 갇힌 \n적들에게 데미지를 입힙니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Black Tempest[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn unleases a murder of crows flying wildly around her, dealing damage to enemies stuck in the storm."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]黑色风暴[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]奎因放出了一大群乌鸦，它们在她周围乱飞，对被困在风暴中的敌人造成伤害。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]黑色風暴[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]奎因放出了一大群烏鴉，它們在她周圍亂飛，對被困在風暴中的敵人造成傷害。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_3_1_1008
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]True Form[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn break her curse and gain back her dark energy live form with ultimate power, killing enemies will extend her transform duration.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Attack: [F2CB7EFF]Energy Ray[-] deals [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Magical damage.\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Skill: [F2CB7EFF]Arcane Blast[-], deals [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] Magical damage and knock enemies back."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Истинный облик[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Квинн снимает проклятье и возвращает свой облик темной энергии, имеющий совершенную силу.\n- [BDB9B6FF]Новая атака: [F2CB7EFF]Луч энергии[-] наносит волшебный урон [98DB51FF]{0}%[-].\n - [BDB9B6FF]Новый навык: [F2CB7EFF]Загадочный взрыв[-] наносит волшебный урон [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] и отбрасывает врагов."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Forma Real[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn quebra a maldição e recupera sua forma de vida de energia sombria com poder supremo. Matar os inimigos aumentará a duração da transformação.[-]\n - [BDB9B6FF]Novo ataque: [F2CB7EFF]Raio de Energia[-] causa [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] de dano mágico.\n- [BDB9B6FF]Nova habilidade: [F2CB7EFF]Explosão Arcana[-], causa [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] de dano mágico e repele os inimigos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Nguyên Thể[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn xóa bỏ lời nguyền, giải phóng toàn bộ năng lượng bóng tối và kích hoạt sức mạnh tối thượng của bản thân.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]Kỹ năng mới: [F2CB7EFF]Tia Năng Lượng[-], gây [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Sát thương Phép Thuật.\n- [BDB9B6FF]Kỹ năng mới: [F2CB7EFF][-]Vụ nổ Năng Lượng[-], gây [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] Sát thương Phép Thuật và đẩy lùi kẻ địch."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Wahre Form[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Quinn bricht ihren Fluch und gewinnt ihre Dunkle-Energie-Lebensform mit ultimativer Kraft zurück. Das Töten von Gegnern verlängert die Dauer ihrer Verwandlung.[-]\n - [BDB9B6FF]Neuer Angriff: [F2CB7EFF]Energiestrahl[-] verursacht [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] magischen Schaden.\n- [BDB9B6FF]Neue Fertigkeit: [F2CB7EFF]Arkaner Schlag[-] verursacht [98DB51FF]{1} %[-] magsichen Schaden und schlägt Gegner zurück."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]True Form[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn break her curse and gain back her dark energy live form with ultimate power, killing enemies will extend her transform duration.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Attack: [F2CB7EFF]Energy Ray[-] deals [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Magical damage.\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Skill: [F2CB7EFF]Arcane Blast[-], deals [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] Magical damage and knock enemies back."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]True Form[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn break her curse and gain back her dark energy live form with ultimate power, killing enemies will extend her transform duration.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Attack: [F2CB7EFF]Energy Ray[-] deals [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Magical damage.\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Skill: [F2CB7EFF]Arcane Blast[-], deals [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] Magical damage and knock enemies back."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]True Form[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn break her curse and gain back her dark energy live form with ultimate power, killing enemies will extend her transform duration.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Attack: [F2CB7EFF]Energy Ray[-] deals [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Magical damage.\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Skill: [F2CB7EFF]Arcane Blast[-], deals [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] Magical damage and knock enemies back."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]真の形態[-] [BDB9B6FF]クインは自身にかかった呪いを解き、究極の力を持つ暗黒エネルギーの生命形態を取り戻す。敵を殺すと変形の持続時間が延長される。[-] -[BDB9B6FF]新しい攻撃：[F2CB7EFF]エネルギー線[-]は[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]の魔法ダメージを与える。 -[BDB9B6FF]新スキル：[F2CB7EFF]秘儀ブラスト[-]は、[98DB51FF]{1}%[-]の魔法ダメージを与え、敵を後方に飛ばす。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ร่างที่แท้จริง[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ควินน์ทำลายคำสาปของเธอ และรับพลังงานแห่งความมืดของเธอกลับคืนมาพร้อมกับพลังมหาศาล และการสังหารศัตรูจะช่วยให้เธอสามารถแปลงร่างได้นานขึ้น[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]การโจมตีใหม่: [F2CB7EFF]ลำแสงพลังงาน[-] สร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n - [BDB9B6FF]สกิลใหม่: [F2CB7EFF]ระเบิดพลังเวท[-] สร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] และทำให้ศัตรูถอยหลังกลับไป"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]True Form[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn break her curse and gain back her dark energy live form with ultimate power, killing enemies will extend her transform duration.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Attack: [F2CB7EFF]Energy Ray[-] deals [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Magical damage.\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Skill: [F2CB7EFF]Arcane Blast[-], deals [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] Magical damage and knock enemies back."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]어둠의 실체[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]자신의 저주를 깬 퀸은 궁극의 힘을 가진 어둠의 실체를 되찾습니다. \n적을 없애면 변신 지속시간이 연장됩니다.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]새로운 공격: [F2CB7EFF]에너지 빔[-]은 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 마법 데미지를 입힙니다.\n- [BDB9B6FF]새로운 스킬: [F2CB7EFF]신비의 폭발[-]은 [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] 마법 데미지를 입히고 적을 뒤로 밀어냅니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]True Form[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Quinn break her curse and gain back her dark energy live form with ultimate power, killing enemies will extend her transform duration.[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Attack: [F2CB7EFF]Energy Ray[-] deals [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Magical damage.\n- [BDB9B6FF]New Skill: [F2CB7EFF]Arcane Blast[-], deals [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] Magical damage and knock enemies back."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]真实形态[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]奎因打破她的诅咒，以终极之力重新获得她的暗能量生命形态，而杀死敌人将延长她的形态转换持续时间。[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]新攻击： [F2CB7EFF]能量光束[-] 造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的魔法伤害。\n - [BDB9B6FF]新技能： [F2CB7EFF]奥术爆破[-]，造成 [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] 魔法伤害并击退敌人。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]真實形態[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]奎因打破她的詛咒，以終極之力重新獲得她的暗能量生命形態，而殺死敵人將延長她的形態轉換持續時間。[-]\n- [BDB9B6FF]新攻擊： [F2CB7EFF]能量光束[-] 造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的魔法傷害。\n - [BDB9B6FF]新技能： [F2CB7EFF]奧術爆破[-]，造成 [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] 魔法傷害並擊退敵人。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1001
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thundering Blow[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount blasts the ground with massive strength before leaping into the air and end with an thunderous strike to the ground below, shredding the armor of enemies hit.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Громовой раскат[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Маунт ударяет о землю с большой силой, после чего подпрыгивает в воздух и наносит еще один удар по земле, раскалывая доспехи врагов.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Golpe Trovejante[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount esmaga o solo com um força enorme antes de saltar no ar, concluindo com um golpe trovejante contra o chão, despedaçando a armadura dos inimigos atingidos.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Búa Sấm Sét[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount giáng đòn sấm sét xuống đầu kẻ địch hai lần với sức mạnh khủng khiếp, đánh vỡ lớp giáp của kẻ địch bị dính đòn.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Donnernder Schlag[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount sprengt den Boden mit massiver Kraft auf, springt in die Luft und kommt mit einem donnernden Schlag auf dem Boden unter ihm auf, der die Rüstung der getroffenen Gegner zerfetzt.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Golpe relampagueante[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount golpea el suelo con enorme fuerza antes de saltar y terminar con un golpe estruendoso hacia el suelo que destruye las armaduras de los enemigos.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Coup de tonnerre[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Le mont souffle sur le sol avec une force massive avant de sauter dans l'air et se termine par un coup de tonnerre sur le sol en dessous, déchiquetant l'armure des ennemis touchés. [-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Colpo Tonante[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount colpisce terra con forza massiccia prima di balzare nell'aria e finire con un Colpo Tonante alla terra sotto, distruggendo l'armatura dei nemici colpiti."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]サンダーブロー[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]巨大な強さで地面を爆破し、空中に飛びぬけ、地面に激しい打撃を加えて敵の鎧を撃破する。[-] \""
      - "[F2CB7EFF]อสนีบาตคลั่ง[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]เมาท์ทุบพื้นอย่างรุนแรงก่อนที่จะกระโดดขึ้นไปในอากาศ และทุบลงมาที่พื้นอย่างรุนแรงปานฟ้าผ่า พร้อมกับบดขยี้เกราะของเหล่าศัตรูที่ถูกโจมตี[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Pukulan Bergemuruh[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount meledakkan tanah dengan kekuatan masif sebelum melompat ke udara dan berakhir dengan serangan bergemuruh ke tanah dibawah, menghancurkan armor musuh yang terkena,[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]천둥의 일격[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]마운트가 강력한 힘으로 땅을 내려쳐서 \n공중으로 솟구친 다음, 땅에 천둥과도 \n같은 무시무시한 일격을 가해서 적의 \n갑옷을 파괴합니다.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thundering Blow[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Sinisira ni Mount ang lupa ng napakalakas bago tumalon sa hangin at tinatapos ito ng dumadagundong na suntok sa ilalim ng lupa, na sumisira sa baluti ng kalaban.[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]雷鸣猛击[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]蒙特用巨大的力量炸开地面，然后跃向空中，最后打出深入地面，宛如雷鸣的暴击，撕碎敌人的防具。[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]雷鳴猛擊[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]蒙特用巨大的力量炸開地面，然後躍向空中，最後打出深入地面，宛如雷鳴的暴擊，撕碎敵人的防具。[-]"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1002
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hurricane[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount performs a playful spinning dance with his hammer, unknowingly dealing damage around him for the duration while also knocking them back."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Ураган[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Маунт танцует, вращая свой молот вокруг себя и нанося урон окружающим врагам, отбрасывая их в стороны."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Furacão[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount executa uma engraçada dança giratória com seu martelo, causando danos de forma inconsciente àqueles que estão em seu redor, derrubando-os."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Bão Sấm[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount vui đùa với cây búa của mình, trở thành một cơn lốc tích điện gây sát thương xung quanh và đánh bật mọi kẻ địch."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hurrikan[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount führt mit seinem Hammer einen spielerischen Drehtanz auf, wodurch er den Gegnern um ihn herum Schaden unwissentlich Schaden zufügt und sie gleichzeitig zurückschlägt."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Huracán[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount realiza una grácil danza giratoria con su martillo y causa daño a su alrededor al tiempo que también derriba a los enemigos."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Ouragan[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount exécute une danse tournoyante avec son marteau, infligeant inconsciemment des dégâts autour de lui tout en les repoussant."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Uragano[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount effettua una danza rotante con il suo martello, facendo danni intorno inconsciamente per tutto il tempo e respingendoli."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ハリケーン[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]マウントは、ハンマーで遊び心のあるスピンダンスを行い、無意識のうちに彼の周りにダメージを与え、打撃する。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]เฮอร์ริเคน[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]เมาท์เต้นหมุนตัวพร้อมกับค้อนของเขาเพื่อทุบโจมตีอย่างสนุกสนาน พร้อมกับสร้างความเสียหายให้กับศัตรูโดยรอบเป็นระยะเวลาหนึ่ง และทำให้ศัตรูกระเด็นถอยกลับไป"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Angin Topan[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount melakukan tarian berputar dengan palunya, secara tidak sengaja memberikan damage di sekitarnya selama durasinya dan mendorong mereka."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]허리케인[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]마운트가 해머를 들고 장난스런 회전 \n춤을 추다가 의도치 않게 주변 적들에게 \n데미지를 입히고 뒤로 밀어버립니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Hurricane[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Sumasayaw si Mount ng paikot gamit ang kanyang martilyo, at hindi pansin na lumilikha ng pinsala sa kanyang paligid habang pinapabagsak sila."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]飓风[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]蒙特用他的锤子表演了一段有趣的旋转舞蹈，在不自觉的情况下对周围的敌人造成了伤害，同时把他们击退。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]颶風[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]蒙特用他的錘子表演了一段有趣的旋轉舞蹈，在不自覺的情況下對周圍的敵人造成了傷害，同時把他們擊退。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1003
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Danger! Bulldozer![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Uses the hammer to charge forward at a rapid pace, literally crushing everything as Mount runs."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Берегитесь кувалды![-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Маунт бросается вперед, используя свой молот, чтобы крушить все на своем пути."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Perigo! Bulldozer![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Utiliza o martelo para atacar rápida e velozmente, esmagando literalmente tudo enquanto Mount corre."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Nguy Hiểm! Xe Ủi Tới![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Sau khi đưa ra cảnh báo nguy hiểm, Mount ủi về phía trước với tốc độ cao, nghiền nát mọi thứ trên đường chạy của mình."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Achtung! Bulldozer![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount setzt seinen Hammer ein, um in rasantem Tempo vorwärts zu sprinten, und zerschmettert dabei buchstäblich alles auf seinem Weg."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]¡Peligro! ¡Topadora![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount usa el martillo para atacar de frente a la carrera, aplastando todo a su paso."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Danger ! Bulldozer ![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Utilise le marteau pour avancer rapidement, écrasant littéralement tout pendant que Mount court."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Pericolo! Bulldozer![-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Usa il martello per caricare in avanti a ritmo intenso, letteralmente frantumando tutto mentre Mount corre."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]危険！ブルドーザー！[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]ハンマーを使って急速に進み、マウントが文字通り走るようにすべてを粉砕します。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]อันตราย! บูลโดเซอร์![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]ใช้ค้อนเพื่อพุ่งโจมตีไปข้างหน้าอย่างรวดเร็ว และบดขยี้ทุกสิ่งที่เมาท์วิ่งผ่าน"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Bahaya! Buldoser![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Menggunakan palu untuk lari ke depan dengan cepat, menghancurkan apapun di depan Mount."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]위험! 불도저![-] \n[BDB9B6FF]해머를 사용해서 빠르게 앞으로 돌진하고 앞에 마주치는 모든 것을 박살냅니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Danger! Bulldozer![-]\n[BDB9B6FF]Ginagamit ang martilyo upang sumugod paabante ng mabilis, at literal na dinudurog ang madadaanan ni Mount."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]危险！推土机！[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]蒙特用锤子以极快的速度向敌方发起冲击，在奔跑的过程中砸碎了一路上的所有东西。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]危險！推土機！[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]蒙特用錘子以極快的速度向敵方發起衝擊，在奔跑的過程中砸碎了一路上的所有東西。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1004
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mjollnir[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount's will materializes into an enormous hammer that chain strikes all enemies ahead for 4 times."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Мьолнир[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Маунт превращается в огромный молот, который 4 раза наносит серию ударов врагам впереди него."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Mjollnir[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount será materializado em um enorme martelo que, em cadeia, atinge 4 vezes todos os inimigos à sua frente."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Búa Mjollnir[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount triệu hồi cây búa khổng lồ, giáng đòn sấm sét lên đầu kẻ địch 4 lần."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mjölnir[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mounts Wille materialisiert in einem riesigen Hammer, der alle Gegner vor ihm 4 Mal hintereinander trifft."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mjollnir[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount's will materializes into an enormous hammer that chain strikes all enemies ahead for 4 times."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mjollnir[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Le Mont se matérialise en un énorme marteau qui enchaîne tous les ennemis 4 fois."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mjollnir[-]  \n[BDB9B6FF]La volontà di Mount si materializza in un enorme martello che scatena colpi su tutti i nemici davanti per 4 volte."
      - "[F2CB7EFF] Mjollnir [-] \n [BDB9B6FF]マウントは4回、チェーンですべての敵に攻撃するという巨大なハンマーになります。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]มโยลเนียร์[-]\n[BDB9B6FF]ค้อนของเมาท์จะขยายร่างใหญ่ขึ้นจนกลายเป็นค้อนยักษ์ พร้อมเข้าโจมตีศัตรูที่อยู่ด้านหน้าทั้งหมดอย่างต่อเนื่อง 4 ครั้ง"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mjollnir[-]  \n[BDB9B6FF]Tekad Mount berubah menjadi palu yang menyerang berantai semua musuh di depan 4 kali."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]묠니르[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]마운트의 무기가 전방에 있는 적들에게 4번의 연속 공격을 가하는 거대한 망치로 \n변신합니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mjollnir[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Si Mount ay nagiging isang malaking martilyo na tumitira ng magkakasunod sa lahat ng kalaban sa unahan ng 4 na beses."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]雷神之锤[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]蒙特的斗志变成了一把巨大的铁锤，这把铁锤会对前方所有的敌人发出4次连击。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]雷神之錘[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]蒙特的鬥志變成了一把巨大的鐵錘，這把鐵錘會對前方所有的敵人發出4次連擊。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1005
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Static Field[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Deploys a totem that opens an electrical field which electrifies nearby opponents for 3 seconds while pushing them backwards."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Статическое поле[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Использует тотем, который вызывает статическое поле, которое поражает электричеством ближайших врагов в течение 3 секунд, отбрасывая их назад."
      - "[F2CB7FEP]Campo Estático[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Aciona um totem que abre um campo elétrico que eletrifica os oponentes mais próximos durante 3 segundos, enquanto os derruba."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Từ Trường[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Triệu hồi cây búa thần phát điện từ có sức mạnh khủng khiếp làm tê liệt và đánh bật kẻ địch xung quanh. Tồn tại trong 3 giây."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Statisches Feld[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Setzt ein Totem ein, das ein elektrisches Feld öffnet, welches Gegner in der Nähe für 3 Sekunden elektrisiert und sie rückwärts schiebt."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Static Field[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Deploys a totem that opens an electrical field which electrifies nearby opponents for 3 seconds while pushing them backwards."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Champ statique[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Déploie un totem qui ouvre un champ électrique qui électrise les adversaires proches pendant 3 secondes tout en les poussant vers l'arrière."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Campo Statico[-]\n  [BDB9B6FF]Attiva un totem che apre un campo elettrico che elettrifica gli avversari vicini per 3 secondi spingendoli indietro."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]静的フィールド[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]トーテムを展開し近くにいる敵を後方に押し込み、3秒間電撃を受けさせる。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]สนามพลังไฟฟ้า[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]ส่งโทเทมออกไปเพื่อสร้างสนามพลังไฟฟ้าที่จะช็อตไฟฟ้าใส่ศัตรูที่อยู่ใกล้เคียงนาน 3 วินาที พร้อมกับผลักพวกเขาให้ถอยหลังกลับไป"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Medan Statis[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Mengeluarkan totem yang membuka medan listrik yang menyetrum musuh di sekitar selama 3 detik sambil mendorong mereka."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]전기장[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]토템을 배치해서 3초 동안 주변의 적들을 감전시키고 뒤로 밀어버리는 전기장을 \n펼칩니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Static Field[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Naglalabas ng isang totem na nagbubukas ng isang electric field na kumukuryente sa malapit na kalaban ng 3 segundo habang itinutulak sila pabalik."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]静电场[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]绘出一个图腾后会出现一个静电场，对附近的敌人发出持续3秒的电击，同时将他们击退。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]靜電場[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]繪出一個圖騰後會出現一個靜電場，對附近的敵人發出持續3秒的電擊，同時將他們擊退。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1006
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga-Blitz[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount leaps forward to execute a booming dive, bouncing the enemies high into the air before blasting them flying with a vigorous spin attack."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Мегаблиц[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Маунт прыгает вперед, подбрасывая врагов воздух и поражая их сильнейшей круговой атакой."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga-Blitz[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount salta para a frente para executar um mergulho explosivo, atirando os inimigos para o ar antes de fazer com que eles destruídos com um vigoroso ataque giratório em voo."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Đột Kích Siêu Đẳng[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount nhảy về phía trước, đánh bật kẻ địch lên cao rồi xoay người đánh bay chúng ra xa như những quả bóng."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga-Blitz[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount springt vorwärts, geht auf seine Gegner los und wirbelt sie hoch in die Luft, wo er sie dann mit einem kräftigen Drehangriff wegbläst."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga-Blitz[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount leaps forward to execute a booming dive, bouncing the enemies high into the air before blasting them flying with a vigorous spin attack."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga flash[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Mount bondi vers l'avant pour exécuter un plongeon en plein essor, faisant rebondir les ennemis en l'air avant de les faire exploser avec une attaque de vrille."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga-Blitz[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Mount balza in avanti per eseguire un tuffo esplosivo, facendo saltare i nemici in aria prima di farli volar via con un vigoroso attacco rotante."
      - "[F2CB7EFF] ギガビット[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]マウントは飛躍的に飛び降り、敵を激しく飛ばし急激なスピン攻撃で爆破する。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]กีก้าบลิทซ์[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]เมาท์พุ่งตัวไปข้างหน้าเพื่อกระแทกให้เหล่าศัตรูกระเด็ดขึ้นไปบนอากาศ ก่อนที่จะฟาดเหล่าศัตรูให้ลอยไปด้วยการหมุนตัวโจมตีอย่างรุนแรง"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga-Blitz[-]  \n  [BDB9B6FF]Mount melompat ke depan untuk melakukan ledakan menukik, memantulkan musuh tinggi ke udara sebelum meledakkan mereka dengan serangan berputar yang kuat."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]기가-블리츠[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]앞으로 뛰어오른 마운트가 강력한 다이빙을 통해 적들을 높이 띄우고 격렬한 회전 \n공격으로 적들을 날려버립니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Giga-Blitz[-]\n [BDB9B6FF]Si Mount ay lulukso pasulong upang maisagawa ang dumadagungdong na pagtalon, at mataas na pinapatalbog sa hangin ang mga kaaway bago sila pasabugin ng malakas na umiikot na atake ng lumilipad."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]十亿闪电[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]蒙特跳向前方，向敌人发起带有雷鸣声的猛冲，把敌人弹到空中，然后再用猛烈的旋转攻击将他们炸飞。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]十億閃電[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]蒙特跳向前方，向敵人發起帶有雷鳴聲的猛衝，把敵人彈到空中，然後再用猛烈的旋轉攻擊將他們炸飛。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1007
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Holy Bulwalk[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Upon activation, remove all crowd control effects affecting Mount, recovers [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] of weapon’s attack power as HP and knocks enemies back for a short distance. While the skill is active, grants Mount [F1AD4DFF]5s[-] invulnerable and [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] damage increase."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Небесный астион[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]При активации снимает с транспорта все эффекты контроля, восстанавливает здоровье в размере [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] от силы атаки оружия и отбрасывает врагов назад на небольшое расстояние. Когда умение активно, придает Транспорту неуязвимость на [F1AD4DFF]5 с[-] и увеличивает урон на [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-]."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Baluarte Sagrado[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Ao ativar, remove todos os efeitos de controle de grupo afetando Mount, recupera [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] de poder de ataque da arma e PV, e repele os inimigos a uma distância curta. Quando a habilidade é ativada, Mount fica [F1AD4DFF]5 s[-] invulnerável e o dano é aumentado em [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-]."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thần Linh Hộ Mệnh[-]\n  [BDB9B6FF]Khi kích hoạt, loại bỏ tất cả các hiệu ứng bất lợi khỏi Mount, hồi máu bằng [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] sức mạnh của vũ khí và đẩy lùi kẻ thù một khoảng cách ngắn. Khi kỹ năng đang kích hoạt, Mount trở nên bất tử trong [F1AD4DFF]5s[-] và tăng sát thương gây ra [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Heiliges Bollwerk[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Nach der Aktivierung werden sämtliche Crowd-Control-Effekte von Mount entfernt, [F1AD4DFF]{0} %[-] der Angriffskraft der Waffe als LP wieder hergestellt und Gegner ein Stück zurückgeschlagen. Solange die Fertigkeit aktiv ist, gewährt sie Mount[F1AD4DFF]5s[-] Unverwundbarkeit und[F1AD4DFF]{1} %[-] Schadenszunahme."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Holy Bulwalk[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Upon activation, remove all crowd control effects affecting Mount, recovers [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] of weapon’s attack power as HP and knocks enemies back for a short distance. While the skill is active, grants Mount [F1AD4DFF]5s[-] invulnerable and [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] damage increase."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Holy Bulwalk[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Upon activation, remove all crowd control effects affecting Mount, recovers [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] of weapon’s attack power as HP and knocks enemies back for a short distance. While the skill is active, grants Mount [F1AD4DFF]5s[-] invulnerable and [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] damage increase."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Holy Bulwalk[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Upon activation, remove all crowd control effects affecting Mount, recovers [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] of weapon’s attack power as HP and knocks enemies back for a short distance. While the skill is active, grants Mount [F1AD4DFF]5s[-] invulnerable and [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] damage increase."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]聖なるブルウォーク[-] [BDB9B6FF]発動すると、マウントに影響する全ての行動妨害効果を取り除き、武器の攻撃力の[F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] をHPとして回復し、敵を少し後方に飛ばす。スキルの発動中、マウントを[F1AD4DFF]5秒間[-]無敵にし、 [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-]のダメージ増加を与える。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ปราการศักดิ์สิทธิ์[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]นำผลเอฟเฟ็กต์ควบคุมฝูงชนที่มีผลกับเมาท์ออกทันทีที่เปิดใช้งาน ฟื้นฟูค่า HP เป็นจำนวน [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] ของค่าพลังโจมตีของอาวุธ และผลักให้เหล่าศัตรูกระเด็นออกไปเป็นระยะทางสั้น ๆ ในขณะที่เปิดใช้งานสกิล มอบสถานะคงกระพันให้กับเมาท์เป็นระยะเวลา [F1AD4DFF]5 วินาที[-] และเพิ่มดาเมจ [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-]"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Holy Bulwalk[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Upon activation, remove all crowd control effects affecting Mount, recovers [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] of weapon’s attack power as HP and knocks enemies back for a short distance. While the skill is active, grants Mount [F1AD4DFF]5s[-] invulnerable and [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] damage increase."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]성스러운 방벽[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]스킬을 활성화시키면 마운트에게 영향을 미치는 모든 군중제어 효과가 사라지고, \n무기 공격력의 [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-]가 HP로 회복되며, 적을 짧은 거리 뒤로 밀어버립니다. \n스킬이 활성화된 동안에는 마운트가 [F1AD4DFF]5초[-] 무적 상태가 되고 데미지가 [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] 증가합니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Holy Bulwalk[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Upon activation, remove all crowd control effects affecting Mount, recovers [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] of weapon’s attack power as HP and knocks enemies back for a short distance. While the skill is active, grants Mount [F1AD4DFF]5s[-] invulnerable and [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] damage increase."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]神圣屏障[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]激活此技能后，所有影响蒙特的群体控制效果均会被消除， [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] 的武器攻击力会被转化为生命值，同时敌人会被击退至不远处。当技能被激活时，蒙特将获得持续 [F1AD4DFF]5秒[-] 的无敌状态，同时伤害值提高 [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] 。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]神聖屏障[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]啟動此技能後，所有影響蒙特的群體控制效果均會被消除， [F1AD4DFF]{0}%[-] 的武器攻擊力會被轉化為生命值，同時敵人會被擊退至不遠處。當技能被啟動時，蒙特將獲得持續 [F1AD4DFF]5秒[-] 的無敵狀態，同時傷害值提高 [F1AD4DFF]{1}%[-] 。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ACTIVE_SKILL_DESC_4_1_1008
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thunder Mount[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount Down!!! Like a big, boom, bang falls from sky with thunder power and crushes everything under his hard, heavy, hammer."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Громовой транспорт[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Вниз!!! Словно большой бадабум, с силой урагана падает с небес и крушит все своим огромным и тяжелым молотом."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Mount Trovejante[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount ataca!!! Como um meteoro caindo do céu com o poder do trovão, ele esmaga tudo no seu caminho com seu grande e glorioso martelo."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Tận Thế[-] \n[BDB9B6FF]Giống như núi đổ, một tiếng nổ lớn vang lên, từ trên trời rơi xuống, chiếc búa với sức mạnh sấm sét nghiền nát mọi thứ."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Donner-Mount[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount fällt!!! Mount stürzt wie ein riesiger Donner vom Himmel und zerquetscht alles unter seinem harten und schweren Hammer."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thunder Mount[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount Down!!! Like a big, boom, bang falls from sky with thunder power and crushes everything under his hard, heavy, hammer."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thunder Mount[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount Down!!! Like a big, boom, bang falls from sky with thunder power and crushes everything under his hard, heavy, hammer."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thunder Mount[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount Down!!! Like a big, boom, bang falls from sky with thunder power and crushes everything under his hard, heavy, hammer."
      - '[F2CB7EFF]雷マウント[-] [BDB9B6FF]マウント襲来！！！とどろく雷のように空から雷の力で飛び降り、固く重いハンマーで全てを潰す。'
      - "[F2CB7EFF]ขี่สายฟ้า[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]เมาท์ทิ้งตัวลงมา!!! ราวกับระเบิดลูกใหญ่ที่ตกลงมาจากฟากฟ้าพร้อมกับพลังแห่งสายฟ้าที่จะบดขยี้ทุกสิ่งที่อยู่ภายใต้ค้อนอันหนักอึ้งของเขา"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thunder Mount[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount Down!!! Like a big, boom, bang falls from sky with thunder power and crushes everything under his hard, heavy, hammer."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]천둥 마운트[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]마운트가 내려옵니다!!! \n하늘에서 거대하고 강력한 천둥과 비슷한 힘으로 내려와 단단하고 무거운 해머로 모든 \n것을 박살냅니다."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]Thunder Mount[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]Mount Down!!! Like a big, boom, bang falls from sky with thunder power and crushes everything under his hard, heavy, hammer."
      - "[F2CB7EFF]闪电蒙特[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]蒙特降临！如同巨大的雷鸣，蒙特带着闪电之力，从天空中落下，并用他坚硬而沉重的锤子把一切都砸碎。"
      - "[F2CB7EFF]閃電蒙特[-] \n [BDB9B6FF]蒙特降臨！如同巨大的雷鳴，蒙特帶著閃電之力，從天空中落下，並用他堅硬而沉重的錘子把一切都砸碎。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
