    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7000
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Выпускает взрывающийся шар, который наносит урон всем врагам впереди и сжигает их.[-]\n Наносит атаку в размере [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n Перезагрузка: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]5[-] раз за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Atira uma bola explosiva, causando dano a todos os inimigos à frente e causando imolação.[-]\n Causando [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] de dano\nTempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\n Use [DBA32BFF]5[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Bắn một quả bóng nổ gây sát thương lên tất cả kẻ thù phía trước và khiến chúng bị thiêu đốt.[-]\nGây [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] sức mạnh tấn công\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF]5[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Feuert einen Sprengball ab, der sämtlichen Gegnern vor ihm Schaden zufügt und sie verbrennt.[-]\n Verursacht [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] Angriffsschaden\nAbklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]5[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]爆発球を放って前方にいる全ての敵にダメージを与え、火傷効果も付与する。[-]\n攻撃効果[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]5[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ยิงบอลระเบิดออกไปเพื่อสร้างความเสียหายให้กับเหล่าศัตรูที่อยู่ด้านหน้าทั้งหมด และทำให้พวกเขาติดสถานะเผาไหม้[-]\nสร้างความเสียหาย [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] ของพลังโจมตี\nเวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]5[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]폭발하는 공을 발사해서 앞에 있는 모든 적들에게 피해를 입히고 불길에 휩싸이게 만듭니다.[-]\n[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 공격력\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]5[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]发射一颗炮弹，对前方所有敌人造成伤害，并引发烧伤状态。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻击力的伤害\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]發射一顆炮彈，對前方所有敵人造成傷害，並引發燒傷狀態。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻擊力的傷害\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
