      - "[BDB9B6FF]Atira uma bola explosiva, causando dano a todos os inimigos à frente e causando imolação.[-]\n Causa [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] de dano\nTempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\n Use [DBA32BFF]5[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Bắn một quả bóng nổ gây sát thương lên tất cả kẻ thù phía trước và khiến chúng bị thiêu đốt. [-]\nGây [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] sức mạnh tấn công\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF]5[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Feuert einen Sprengball ab, der allen Gegnern vor ihm Schaden zufügt und sie verbrennt.[-]\n Verursacht [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] Angriffsschaden\nAbklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]5[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]爆発球を放って前方にいる全ての敵にダメージを与え、火傷効果も付与する。[-]\n攻撃効果[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]5[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ยิงบอลระเบิดออกไปเพื่อสร้างความเสียหายให้กับเหล่าศัตรูที่อยู่ด้านหน้าทั้งหมด และทำให้พวกเขาติดสถานะเผาไหม้[-]\nสร้างความเสียหาย [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] ของพลังโจมตี\nเวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]5[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]폭발하는 공을 발사해서 앞에 있는 모든 적들에게 피해를 입히고 불길에 휩싸이게 만듭니다.[-]\n[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 공격력\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]5[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Fires an explosive ball dealing damage to all enemies in front and cause them burned.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]发射一颗炮弹，对前方所有敌人造成伤害，并引发烧伤状态。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻击力的伤害\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]發射一顆炮彈，對前方所有敵人造成傷害，並引發燒傷狀態。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻擊力的傷害\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7001
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You create a blood mist surround and become bloodlust, increase your Damage deal by , increase your Damage receive.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack \nIncrease [DBA32BFF]10%[-] damage receive\nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Вы создаете вокруг себя кровавый туман и обретаете кровожадность, что увеличивает наносимый вами урон наи увеличивает получаемый вами урон.[-]\n Увеличивает атаку на [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] \n Увеличивает получаемый урон на [DBA32BFF]10%[-]\n Длительность: [DBA32BFF]12[-] с\n Перезагрузка: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]5[-] раз за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Cria um nevoeiro sangrento ao redor e fica enfurecido, aumentando o dano causado e o dano recebido.[-]\n Aumenta em [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] o ataque \n Aumenta em [DBA32BFF]10%[-] o dano recebido\n Dura [DBA32BFF]12[-] segundos\nTempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\n Use [DBA32BFF]5[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Bạn tạo ra một màn sương máu bao quanh và trở nên điên cuồng, gia tăng sát thương gây ra đồng thời tăng sát thương gánh chịu. [-]\nTăng [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] sát thương\nSát thương gánh chịu tăng [DBA32BFF]10%[-]\nLâu nhất trong [DBA32BFF]12[-] giây\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF] 5 [-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Du erzeugst einen Blutnebel um dich herum und wirst blutrünstig. Dein zugefügter Schaden erhöht sich um , erhöht auch deinen erlittenen Schaden.[-]\n Erhöht den Angriff um [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] \n Erhöht den erlittenen Schaden um [DBA32BFF]10 %[-]\n Hält [DBA32BFF]12[-] Sekunden\nAbklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]5[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You create a blood mist surround and become bloodlust, increase your Damage deal by , increase your Damage receive.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack \nIncrease [DBA32BFF]10%[-] damage receive\nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You create a blood mist surround and become bloodlust, increase your Damage deal by , increase your Damage receive.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack \nIncrease [DBA32BFF]10%[-] damage receive\nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You create a blood mist surround and become bloodlust, increase your Damage deal by , increase your Damage receive.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack \nIncrease [DBA32BFF]10%[-] damage receive\nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]血の霧を周囲に霧散させ、ブラッドラスト状態になる。攻撃力が上がるが、敵から受けるダメージも大きくなる。[-]\n攻撃力[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]アップ\n被ダメージ[DBA32BFF]10%[-]アップ\n効果は[DBA32BFF]12[-]秒間持続\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]5[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ท่านได้สร้างหมอกไอโลหิตขึ้นรอบตัวและติดสถานะกระหายเลือด ซึ่งจะเพิ่มดาเมจที่ท่านสร้างได้ และเพิ่มดาเมจที่ท่านได้รับ[-]\nเพิ่มพลังโจมตี [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n เพิ่มดาเมจที่ได้รับ [DBA32BFF]10%[-]\n ระยะเวลา [DBA32BFF]12[-] วินาที\n เวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]5[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You create a blood mist surround and become bloodlust, increase your Damage deal by , increase your Damage receive.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack \nIncrease [DBA32BFF]10%[-] damage receive\nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]주변을 피의 안개로 둘러싸고 강력한 피의 충동을 일으켜서, 자신이 주는 데미지가 증가하고 받는 데미지도 증가합니다.[-]\n공격력 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 증가\n받는 데미지 [DBA32BFF]10%[-] 증가\n[DBA32BFF]12[-]초 동안 지속\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]5[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You create a blood mist surround and become bloodlust, increase your Damage deal by , increase your Damage receive.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack \nIncrease [DBA32BFF]10%[-] damage receive\nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]你在周围创造出一片血雾，同时产生嗜血状态，同时提高你攻击的伤害值和可承受的伤害值。[-]\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的攻击力 \n 提高 [DBA32BFF]10%[-] 的伤害承受值\n 持续 [DBA32BFF]12[-] 秒\n冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]你在周圍創造出一片血霧，同時產生嗜血狀態，同時提高你攻擊的傷害值和可承受的傷害值。[-]\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的攻擊力 \n 提高 [DBA32BFF]10%[-] 的傷害承受值\n 持續 [DBA32BFF]12[-] 秒\n冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
