    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7002_NEW
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]With power of dragon, your normal Attack will deal extra attack as Magic damage.[-]\nDeal more [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]7[-] seconds\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]С силой дракона ваша обычная атака наносит дополнительный магический урон.[-]\nНаносит дополнительный урон [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-]\n Длительность [DBA32BFF]7[-] с\n Восстановление [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]5[-] раз за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Com o poder do dragão, seu ataque normal causa mais dano como ataque mágico.[-]\n Causa mais [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] de ataque\nDura [DBA32BFF]7[-] segundos\n Tempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Với sức mạnh của Rồng, đòn đánh thường của bạn sẽ gây thêm sát thương phép [-]\nGây thêm [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] sức tấn công\nLâu nhất trong [DBA32BFF]7[-] giây\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF]5[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Mit der Kraft des Drachen bewirkt dein normaler Angriff zusätzlichen Angriffsschaden als magischen Schaden.[-]\n Erhöht den Angriffsschaden um [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg} %[-]\n Hält [DBA32BFF]7[-] Sekunden\n Abklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]5[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]With power of dragon, your normal Attack will deal extra attack as Magic damage.[-]\nDeal more [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]7[-] seconds\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]With power of dragon, your normal Attack will deal extra attack as Magic damage.[-]\nDeal more [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]7[-] seconds\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]With power of dragon, your normal Attack will deal extra attack as Magic damage.[-]\nDeal more [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]7[-] seconds\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ドラゴンの力を借り、魔法による追加ダメージが通常攻撃に付加される。[-]\n攻撃ダメージ追加[98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-]\n効果は[DBA32BFF]7[-]秒間持続\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]5[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ใช้พลังของมังกรเพื่อทำให้การโจมตีปกติของคุณสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์เพิ่มเติม[-]\nสร้างความเสียหายเพิ่มเติม [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] ของพลังโจมตี\nระยะเวลา [DBA32BFF]7[-] วินาที\nเวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]5[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]With power of dragon, your normal Attack will deal extra attack as Magic damage.[-]\nDeal more [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]7[-] seconds\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]드래곤의 힘을 받아 당신의 보통 공격은 마법 데미지만큼 더 큰 공격력을 발휘합니다.[-]\n공격력 [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] 증가\n[DBA32BFF]7[-]초 동안 지속\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]5[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]With power of dragon, your normal Attack will deal extra attack as Magic damage.[-]\nDeal more [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]7[-] seconds\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]使用龙的力量，你的正常攻击会造成额外的魔法伤害。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] 攻击力的额外伤害\n持续 [DBA32BFF]7[-] 秒\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]使用龍的力量，你的正常攻擊會造成額外的魔法傷害。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{additionalDmg}%[-] 攻擊力的額外傷害\n持續 [DBA32BFF]7[-] 秒\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
