    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7003
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You chose to drink a mystery magic potion, increase Attack for next skill attack.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] skill damage\nLast for [DBA32BFF]10[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Вы пьете таинственное волшебное зелье, которое увеличивает урон следующего атакующего навыка.[-]\nУвеличивает урон навыка на [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n Длительность: [DBA32BFF]10[-] с\n Перезагрузка: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]5[-] раз за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Você tomou a poção mágica misteriosa, aumentando o ataque da próxima habilidade.[-]\n Aumenta em [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] o dano de habilidade\nDura [DBA32BFF]10[-] segundos\n Tempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Bạn đã chọn uống một lọ thuốc ma thuật bí ẩn, tăng sát thương cho kỹ năng tiếp theo. [-]\nTăng [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] sát thương kỹ năng\nLâu nhất trong [DBA32BFF]10[-] giây\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng[DBA32BFF]5[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Du trinkst einen geheimnisvollen Zaubertrank. Dein Angriff erhöht sich beim nächsten Fertigkeitsangriff.[-]\n Erhöht den Fertigkeitsschaden um [98DB51FF]{0} %[-]\n Hält [DBA32BFF]10[-] Sekunden\n Abklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]5[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You chose to drink a mystery magic potion, increase Attack for next skill attack.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] skill damage\nLast for [DBA32BFF]10[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You chose to drink a mystery magic potion, increase Attack for next skill attack.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] skill damage\nLast for [DBA32BFF]10[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You chose to drink a mystery magic potion, increase Attack for next skill attack.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] skill damage\nLast for [DBA32BFF]10[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]謎の魔法のポーションを飲むことにより、次のスキルアタックの攻撃力が上がる。[-]\nスキルダメージ[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]アップ\n効果は[DBA32BFF]10[-]秒間持続\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]5[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ท่านเลือกที่จะดื่มน้ำยาเวทมนตร์ลึกลับ ซึ่งจะเพิ่มพลังโจมตีในการโจมตีด้วยสกิลในครั้งถัดไป[-]\nเพิ่มดาเมจของสกิล [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n ระยะเวลา [DBA32BFF]10[-] วินาที\n เวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]5[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You chose to drink a mystery magic potion, increase Attack for next skill attack.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] skill damage\nLast for [DBA32BFF]10[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]불가사의한 마법의 물약을 마셔서 다음 스킬 공격의 공격력이 증가합니다.[-]\n스킬 데미지 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]증가\n[DBA32BFF]10[-]초 동안 지속\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]5[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You chose to drink a mystery magic potion, increase Attack for next skill attack.[-]\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] skill damage\nLast for [DBA32BFF]10[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]你选择喝下一种神秘的魔法药剂，下一次技能攻击的攻击力提高。[-]\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的技能伤害值\n 持续 [DBA32BFF]10[-] 秒\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]你選擇喝下一種神秘的魔法藥劑，下一次技能攻擊的攻擊力提高。[-]\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的技能傷害值\n 持續 [DBA32BFF]10[-] 秒\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
