      - "[BDB9B6FF]你選擇喝下一種神秘的魔法藥劑，下一次技能攻擊的攻擊力提高。[-]\n提高 [98DB51FF]{skillDmgBonus}%[-] 的技能傷害值\n持續 [DBA32BFF]10[-] 秒\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7004
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]While out of combat, you recover HP per second, this effect will end if you took any damage.[-]\nRecover total [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] HP\nLast for [DBA32BFF]5[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Не участвуя в бою, вы каждую секунду восстанавливаете здоровье.\n Общее восстановление здоровья: [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n Длительность: [DBA32BFF]5[-] с\n Перезагрузка: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]5[-] раз за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Recupera PV por segundo quando está fora de batalha, o efeito é cortado ao receber dano.[-]\n Recupere um total de [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] de PV\n Dura [DBA32BFF]5[-] segundos\n Tempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Khi đứng ngoài giao tranh, bạn hồi phục máu mỗi giây, hiệu ứng này sẽ kết thúc nếu bạn chịu bất kỳ sát thương nào.[-]\nKhôi phục tối đa [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Máu\nLâu nhất trong [DBA32BFF]5[-] giây\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF]5[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Außerhalb des Kampfes stellst du jede Sekunde LP wieder her. Der Effekt endet, sobald du Schaden erleidest.[-]\n Stellt insgesamt [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] LP wieder her\n Hält [DBA32BFF]5[-] Sekunden\n Abklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]5[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]While out of combat, you recover HP per second, this effect will end if you took any damage.[-]\nRecover total [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] HP\nLast for [DBA32BFF]5[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]While out of combat, you recover HP per second, this effect will end if you took any damage.[-]\nRecover total [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] HP\nLast for [DBA32BFF]5[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]While out of combat, you recover HP per second, this effect will end if you took any damage.[-]\nRecover total [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] HP\nLast for [DBA32BFF]5[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]バトルを避けている間、1秒毎に一定HPが回復。ダメージを受けると効果は終了する。[-]\nトータル[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]のHPを回復\n効果は[DBA32BFF]5[-]秒間持続\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]5[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ขณะอยู่นอกการต่อสู้ ท่านจะได้รับการฟื้นฟูค่า HP ต่อวินาที และผลจะหมดลงในทันทีที่ท่านได้รับความเสียหาย[-]\nฟื้นฟูค่า HP ทั้งหมด [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n ระยะเวลา [DBA32BFF]5[-] วินาที\n เวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]5[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]While out of combat, you recover HP per second, this effect will end if you took any damage.[-]\nRecover total [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] HP\nLast for [DBA32BFF]5[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]전투 중에 적으로부터 데미지를 받지 않는 동안에는 매 초마다 HP를 회복합니다. 이 효과는 데미지를 받으면 중단됩니다.[-]\n총 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] HP 회복\n[DBA32BFF]5[-]초 동안 지속\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]5[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]While out of combat, you recover HP per second, this effect will end if you took any damage.[-]\nRecover total [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] HP\nLast for [DBA32BFF]5[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]5[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]退出战斗时，生命值每秒持续恢复，此效果将持续到你再次受到伤害。[-]\n恢复共 [98DB51FF]{0}% [-] 的生命值\n 持续 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 秒\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]退出戰鬥時，生命值每秒持續恢復，此效果將持續到你再次受到傷害。[-]\n恢復共 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的生命值\n 持續 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 秒\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]5[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
