    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7005
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Creates a link between you and an enemy in front, increase your Attack and Defense, decrease the same amount for the target. That link will end if you or your enemies get out of range.[-]\nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Attack \nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Defense \nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Создает связь между вами и врагом перед вами, увеличивает вашу атаку и защиту и уменьшает эти параметры в том же размере для врага. Связь прерывается, если вы или ваши враги выходите из зоны действия.[-]\nУвеличивает атаку на [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] \n Увеличивает защиту на [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] \n Длительность: [DBA32BFF]12[-] с\n Перезагрузка: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]3[-] раза за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Cria uma ligação com o inimigo à frente, aumentando o seu ataque e a sua defesa e diminuindo a mesma quantidade do alvo. A ligação é encerrada quando o inimigo sai do alcance.[-]\n Aumenta em [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] o ataque \n Aumenta em [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] a defesa \n Dura [DBA32BFF]12[-] segundos\nTempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\n Use [DBA32BFF]3[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Tạo liên kết hút sức mạnh của mục tiêu và gia tăng sức mạnh đó lên bản thân. Liên kết đó sẽ bị phá vỡ nếu nằm ngoài phạm vi tối đa. [-]\nTăng [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Tấn công & phòng thủ mỗi giây\nGiảm kẻ thù [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Tấn công & phòng thủ mỗi giây\nLần cuối trong [DBA32BFF]12[-] giây\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF]3[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Erzeugt eine Verbindung zwischen dir und dem Gegner vor dir, erhöht deinen Angriff und deine Abwehr, um die gleiche Menge wird dies bei deinem Ziel verringert. Die Verbindung endet, wenn du oder deine Gegner außer Reichweite geraten.[-]\n Erhöht den Angriff um [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] \n Erhöht die Abwehr um [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] \n Hält [DBA32BFF]12[-] Sekunden\n Abklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]3[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Creates a link between you and an enemy in front, increase your Attack and Defense, decrease the same amount for the target. That link will end if you or your enemies get out of range.[-]\nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Attack \nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Defense \nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Creates a link between you and an enemy in front, increase your Attack and Defense, decrease the same amount for the target. That link will end if you or your enemies get out of range.[-]\nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Attack \nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Defense \nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Creates a link between you and an enemy in front, increase your Attack and Defense, decrease the same amount for the target. That link will end if you or your enemies get out of range.[-]\nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Attack \nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Defense \nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ターゲットとの「結び付き」を創り出す、自分の攻撃力と防御力が上がった分、相手のが下がる。ただし、ターゲットが範囲外に出てしまうと、結び付きは消失する。[-]\n攻撃力[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]アップ\n防御力[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]アップ\n効果は[DBA32BFF]12[-]秒持続\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]3[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]สร้างการเชื่อมโยงระหว่างท่านและศัตรูที่อยู่ตรงหน้า พร้อมกับเพิ่มพลังโจมตีและพลังป้องกันขึ้น พร้อมกับลดค่าพลังของเป้าหมายลงในจำนวนที่เท่ากัน การเชื่อมโยงจะสิ้นสุดลงทันทีที่ท่านหรือศัตรูอยู่นอกระยะ[-]\nเพิ่มพลังโจมตี [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] \n เพิ่มพลังป้องกัน [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] \n ระยะเวลา [DBA32BFF]12[-] วินาที\n เวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]3[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Creates a link between you and an enemy in front, increase your Attack and Defense, decrease the same amount for the target. That link will end if you or your enemies get out of range.[-]\nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Attack \nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Defense \nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]당신과 전방에 있는 적 사이에 링크를 만들어 자신의 공격력과 방어력을 증가시키고 적의 공격력과 방어력은 같은 수치만큼 감소시킵니다. 이 링크는 당신이나 적이 범위 밖으로 벗어나면 사라집니다.[-]\n공격력 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 증가 \n방어력 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 증가 \n[DBA32BFF]12[-]초 동안 지속\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]3[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Creates a link between you and an enemy in front, increase your Attack and Defense, decrease the same amount for the target. That link will end if you or your enemies get out of range.[-]\nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Attack \nIncrease[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Defense \nLast for [DBA32BFF]12[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]在你和目标之间创建一个连接，提高你的攻击力和防御力，并减少目标相同数值的攻击力和防御力。如果超出最大范围，该连接将断裂。[-]\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻击力\n 提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 防御力\n持续 [DBA32BFF]12[-] 秒\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]在你和前排敵人之間建立一道連線，藉此提高你的攻擊力及防禦力，同時降低目標相同數值的攻擊力及防禦力。若你或敵人超出範圍，該連線將會斷裂。[-]\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻擊力 \n 提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 防禦力 \n 持續 [DBA32BFF]12[-] 秒\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
