      - "[BDB9B6FF]You strengthen your power and opens up two portals to the Void. After a short delay, deal Magical Damage and stun all enemies.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds.\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You strengthen your power and opens up two portals to the Void. After a short delay, deal Magical Damage and stun all enemies.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds.\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]自分の攻撃力を強化＆2つのポータルを虚空に開く。わずかな時間のズレの後、ポータル間にいる全ての敵に魔法ダメージ、さらにスタン状態にする。[-]\n攻撃効果[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n効果は[DBA32BFF]8[-]秒持続\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]3[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ท่านได้เสริมพลังความแข็งแกร่งและเปิดประตูมิติ 2 บาน สู่ความว่างเปล่า ซึ่งจะสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์และทำให้เหล่าศัตรูติดสถานะมึนงง หลังจากเปิดใช้งานไปสักครู่ [-]\n สร้างความเสียหาย [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] ของพลังโจมตี\nระยะเวลา [DBA32BFF]8[-] วินาที\nเวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]3[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You strengthen your power and opens up two portals to the Void. After a short delay, deal Magical Damage and stun all enemies.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds.\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]힘을 강화하여 공허의 공간으로 이어지는 포털 두 개를 엽니다. 약간의 지연 후에, 모든 적들에게 마법 데미지를 입히고 기절시킵니다.[-]\n[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 공격력 \n[DBA32BFF]8[-]초 동안 지속\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]3[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]You strengthen your power and opens up two portals to the Void. After a short delay, deal Magical Damage and stun all enemies.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds.\nCooldown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]你强化自身的力量，同时打开了两个通往虚空的入口。在短暂的延迟之后，造成魔法伤害并使所有敌人晕眩。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻击力的伤害\n 持续 [DBA32BFF]8[-] 秒\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]你強化自身的力量，同時打開了兩個通往虛空的入口。在短暫的延遲之後，造成魔法傷害並使所有敵人暈眩。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻擊力的傷害\n 持續 [DBA32BFF]8[-] 秒\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7007
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]In active time, your eyes can clearly see almost every normal attack that target you and increase dodge it.[-]\nCan only use in Arena\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Dodge\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]При активации способности ваши глаза могут видеть практически каждую обычную атаку, направленную на вас, а ваш шанс уклонения увеличивается.[-]\nМожно использовать только на Арене\nУвеличивает уклонение на [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\nДлительность: [DBA32BFF]8[-] с\n Перезагрузка: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]3[-] раза за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Seus olhos podem ver com clareza quase todos os ataques normais desferidos contra você, aumentando a sua esquiva.[-]\n Só pode ser usado na Arena\nAumenta em [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] a esquiva\n Dura [DBA32BFF]8[-] segundos\n Tempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\n Use [DBA32BFF]3[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Trong thời gian hoạt động, mắt bạn có thể thấy rõ mọi cuộc tấn công vào bản thân bạn và có tỉ lệ né tránh chúng . [-]\nChỉ có thể sử dụng trong Đấu Trường\nTăng [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] tỉ lệ né tránh\nLần cuối trong [DBA32BFF]8[-] giây\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF]3[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Solange dies aktiv ist, können deine Augen beinahe jeden normalen Angriff wahrnehmen, der dich anvisiert, und ihm ausweichen.[-]\n Nur in der Arena verwendbar\n Erhöht Ausweichen um [98DB51FF]{0} %[-]\n Hält [DBA32BFF]8[-] Sekunden\n Abklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n [DBA32BFF]3[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]In active time, your eyes can clearly see almost every normal attack that target you and increase dodge it.[-]\nCan only use in Arena\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Dodge\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]In active time, your eyes can clearly see almost every normal attack that target you and increase dodge it.[-]\nCan only use in Arena\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Dodge\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]In active time, your eyes can clearly see almost every normal attack that target you and increase dodge it.[-]\nCan only use in Arena\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Dodge\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]このスキルが発動中、自分がターゲットにされているほぼ全ての通常攻撃が「見える」ようになり、回避確率が上がる[-]\nアリーナでのみ使用可能\n回避率[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]アップ\n効果は[DBA32BFF]8[-]秒持続\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]3[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ขณะเปิดใช้งาน ดวงตาของท่านสามารถมองเห็นการโจมตีปกติทั้งหมดที่เล็งมาที่ท่านได้อย่างชัดเจน และเพิ่มความสามารถในการหลบ[-]\nใช้งานได้ในลานประลองเท่านั้น\nเพิ่มการดอดจ์ [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n ระยะเวลา [DBA32BFF]8[-] วินาที\n เวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]3[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]In active time, your eyes can clearly see almost every normal attack that target you and increase dodge it.[-]\nCan only use in Arena\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Dodge\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]활성화됐을 때 당신의 눈은 당신을 향해 날아오는 거의 모든 보통 공격을 정확하게 포착하고 빠르게 회피합니다.[-]\n아레나에서만 사용 가능\n회피력 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 증가\n[DBA32BFF]8[-]초 동안 지속\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]3[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]In active time, your eyes can clearly see almost every normal attack that target you and increase dodge it.[-]\nCan only use in Arena\nIncrease [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] Dodge\nLast for [DBA32BFF]8[-] seconds\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]在激活时间内，你的眼睛几乎可以清楚地看到以你为目标的每一次普通攻击，并提高闪避率。[-]\n只能在竞技场中使用\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的闪避率\n 持续 [DBA32BFF]8[-] 秒\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]在啟動時間內，你的眼睛幾乎可以清楚地看到以你為目標的每一次普通攻擊，並提高閃避率。[-]\n只能在競技場中使用\n提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 的閃避率\n 持續 [DBA32BFF]8[-] 秒\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
