    - Term: ANCIENT_SKILL_DESC_7008
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Emits a freezing wave that deals Magical Damage to all enemies nearby, slows their movement and cause Cold Burn.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Создает замораживающую волну, которая наносит магический урон всем врагам поблизости, замедляет их движение и вызывает обморожение.[-]\nНаносит атаку в размере [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\n Перезагрузка: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] с\n Используется [DBA32BFF]3[-] раза за бой"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Cria uma onda gélida, causando dano mágico a todos os inimigos próximos, diminuindo a velocidade de movimento deles e causando queimadura de frio.[-]\n Causa [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] de dano\n Tempo de recarga de [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] segundos\n Use [DBA32BFF]3[-] vezes por batalha"
      - "[BDB9B6FF] Phát ra một làn sóng đóng băng gây sát thương phép thuật cho tất cả kẻ thù gần đó, làm chậm chuyển động của chúng và gây ra hiệu ứng Băng Huyết.[-]\nGây sát thương [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\nThời gian hồi chiêu [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] giây\nSử dụng [DBA32BFF]3[-] lần cho mỗi trận chiến"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Sendet eine Eiswelle aus, die allen Gegnern in der Nähe magischen Schaden zufügt, ihre Bewegung verlangsamt und Kaltverbrennung verursacht.[-]\nVerursacht [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] Angriffsschaden\n Abklingzeit [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] Sekunden\n[DBA32BFF]3[-] Mal pro Kampf benutzbar"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Emits a freezing wave that deals Magical Damage to all enemies nearby, slows their movement and cause Cold Burn.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Emits a freezing wave that deals Magical Damage to all enemies nearby, slows their movement and cause Cold Burn.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Emits a freezing wave that deals Magical Damage to all enemies nearby, slows their movement and cause Cold Burn.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]凍てつく波動を放出して、近くにいる全ての敵に魔法ダメージを与え、動きを遅くして、低温火傷効果も付与する。[-]\n攻撃効果[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]\nクールダウン[DBA32BFF]{1}[-]秒\n1回のバトルで[DBA32BFF]3[-]回使用可能"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]ปล่อยคลื่นเยือกแข็งออกไปพร้อมกับสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ให้กับเหล่าศัตรูที่อยู่ใกล้เคียงทั้งหมด ทำให้พวกเขาเคลื่อนที่ช้าลง และติดสถานะน้ำแข็งกัด[-]\nสร้างความเสียหาย [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] ของพลังโจมตี\nเวลาคูลดาวน์ [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] วินาที\n ใช้ได้ [DBA32BFF]3[-] ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Emits a freezing wave that deals Magical Damage to all enemies nearby, slows their movement and cause Cold Burn.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]주변 모든 적들에게 마법 데미지를 입히고, 이동 속도를 감소시키고, 동상을 유발하는 냉기를 내뿜습니다.[-]\n[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 공격력\n대기시간: [DBA32BFF]{1}[-]초\n전투당 [DBA32BFF]3[-]번 사용 가능"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Emits a freezing wave that deals Magical Damage to all enemies nearby, slows their movement and cause Cold Burn.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]发出一股寒潮，对周围所有敌人造成魔法伤害，减慢其移动速度，并引发冻伤状态。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻击力的伤害\n 冷却时间 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每场战斗使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
      - "[BDB9B6FF]發出一股寒潮，對周圍所有敵人造成魔法傷害，減慢其移動速度，並引發凍傷狀態。[-]\n造成 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 攻擊力的傷害\n 冷卻時間 [DBA32BFF]{1}[-] 秒\n 每場戰鬥使用 [DBA32BFF]3[-] 次"
