      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[BDB9B6FF]Shooting a chasing bullet that home in on its target for few seconds. The bullet deals magical damage when hit and can cause instant death if its target's HP is below {1}%.[-]\nDealing [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack\nKill target under [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] HP\nColddown [DBA32BFF]{2}[-] seconds\nUse [DBA32BFF]3[-] times per battle"
