    - Term: ARENA_PROMOTION_NEW_RANK_POPUP
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Congrats reaching new league for the first time\nYou can claim your rewards in Arena-Reward list"
      - "Поздравляем, вы впервые достигли новой лиги!\n Вы можете получить свои награды в списке наград за арену"
      - "Parabéns por chegar em uma nova liga pela primeira vez\n Você pode resgatar as recompensas na lista de recompensas da Arena"
      - Chào mừng lên hạng đấu mới lần đầu tiên. Bạn có thể nhận phần thưởng của mình trong phần thưởng Đấu trường
      - "Herzlichen Glückwunsch zum ersten Aufstieg in eine neue Liga\n Du kannst deine Belohnungen in der Arena-Belohnungsliste abholen"
      - "Congrats reaching new league for the first time\nYou can claim your rewards in Arena-Reward list"
      - "Congrats reaching new league for the first time\nYou can claim your rewards in Arena-Reward list"
      - "Congrats reaching new league for the first time\nYou can claim your rewards in Arena-Reward list"
      - "新たなリーグ到達おめでとうございます\nアリーナ報酬リストから報酬を受け取ってください"
      - "ขอแสดงความยินดีที่ได้รับเลื่อนขั้นไปสู่ลีกใหม่เป็นครั้งแรก\nท่านสามารถรับรางวัลของท่านได้ในรายการรางวัลลานประลอง"
      - "Congrats reaching new league for the first time\nYou can claim your rewards in Arena-Reward list"
      - "처음으로 새 리그에 도달한 것을 축하드립니다.\n보상은 아레나-보상 목록에서 받을 수 있습니다."
      - "Congrats reaching new league for the first time\nYou can claim your rewards in Arena-Reward list"
      - "恭喜你首次晋级新联赛\n 你可以在竞技场奖励清单中领取你的奖励"
      - "恭喜你初次參與全新聯賽\n 你可以在「競技場獎勵」清單中領取獎勵"
