    - Term: ARENA_REQUEST_114
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "The server will be under maintenance from 9AM (GMT+7) to 17PM (GTM+7)\nThe Duel Arena will not be available during that time anywhere"
      - "С 9:00 до 17:00 (время по Гринвичу +7) на сервере будут проводиться регламентные работы.\nВ течение этого периода арена поединков будет недоступна"
      - "O servidor estará em manutenção de 09h00 (GMT+7) a 17h00 (GTM+7)\nA Arena de Duelo não estará disponível durante este período"
      - "Máy chủ sẽ được bảo trì từ 9 giờ sáng (GMT + 7) đến 17 giờ tối (GMT + 7)\nĐấu Trường Sinh Tử sẽ không hoạt động trong suốt thời gian này."
      - "Der Server wird von 9 Uhr (GMT+7) bis 17 Uhr (GTM+7) gewartet.\n Während dieser Zeit ist die Duell-Arena nirgendwo verfügbar."
      - "The server will be under maintenance from 9AM (GMT+7) to 17PM (GTM+7)\nThe Duel Arena will not be available during that time anywhere"
      - "The server will be under maintenance from 9AM (GMT+7) to 17PM (GTM+7)\nThe Duel Arena will not be available during that time anywhere"
      - "The server will be under maintenance from 9AM (GMT+7) to 17PM (GTM+7)\nThe Duel Arena will not be available during that time anywhere"
      - 午前9時（GMT + 7）から午後17時（GTM + 7）までサーバーのメンテナンスを行います メンテナンス中にデュエルアリーナは利用できません
      - "เซิร์ฟเวอร์จะปิดปรับปรุงตั้งแต่ในเวลา 9 น.(GMT+7) จนถึง 17 น. (GTM+7)\n สนามประลองทุกแห่งจะไม่พร้อมใช้งานในระหว่างช่วงเวลาดังกล่าว"
      - "The server will be under maintenance from 9AM (GMT+7) to 17PM (GTM+7)\nThe Duel Arena will not be available during that time anywhere"
      - "9AM (GMT+7)부터 17PM (GTM+7)까지 서버 점검이 진행됩니다.\n 해당 시간 동안에는 어떤 지역에서도 대전 아레나를 이용할 수 없습니다."
      - "The server will be under maintenance from 9AM (GMT+7) to 17PM (GTM+7)\nThe Duel Arena will not be available during that time anywhere"
      - "服务器将于上午9点（GMT+7）到下午17点（GTM+7）进行维护。\n在这段时间内，任何地区的竞技场均不可用"
      - "伺服器將於上午9點（GMT+7）到下午17點（GTM+7）進行維護。\n在這段時間內，任何地區的競技場均不可用"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
