    - Term: ARENA_REQUEST_ERROR_NOT_ELIGIBLE
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Character data is manipulated illegally then you're not able to join arena.\nPlease contact us via facebook page inbox for more information. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \nThank you for your understanding."
      - "Были выполнены незаконные действия с данными персонажем, поэтому вы не можете вступить на арену.\nДля получения подробной информации напишите нам сообщение на нашей странице в Facebook. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \n Спасибо за понимание!"
      - "Os dados do personagem foram manipulados ilegalmente e não será possível entrar na Arena.\n Entre em contato pela página do Facebook para obter mais informações. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \n Obrigado pela compreensão."
      - "Dữ liệu của bạn đã bị chỉnh sửa phi pháp, bạn đã bị cấm vào Arena\nVui lòng liên hệ qua facebook để biết thêm chi tiết. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame."
      - "Die Charakterdaten wurden illegal manipuliert, daher kannst du die Arena nicht betreten.\n Bitte kontaktiere uns über unsere Facebook-Seite für weitere Informationen. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \n Vielen Dank für dein Verständnis."
      - "Character data is manipulated illegally then you're not able to join arena.\nPlease contact us via facebook page inbox for more information. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \nThank you for your understanding."
      - "Character data is manipulated illegally then you're not able to join arena.\nPlease contact us via facebook page inbox for more information. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \nThank you for your understanding."
      - "Character data is manipulated illegally then you're not able to join arena.\nPlease contact us via facebook page inbox for more information. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \nThank you for your understanding."
      - キャラクターのデータを違法に操作すると、アリーナに参加できません。 詳細はFacebookページのメッセージ機能を介してお問い合わせください。 facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame ご理解ありがとうございます。
      - "มีการปรับแต่งข้อมูลตัวละครอย่างผิดกฎหมาย และท่านไม่สามารถเข้าร่วมสนามประลองได้\nโปรดติดต่อเพื่อขอรับข้อมูลเพิ่มเติมจากเราได้ผ่านทางกล่องข้อความของหน้าเฟซบุ๊ก facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \n ขอขอบคุณสำหรับความเข้าใจ"
      - "Character data is manipulated illegally then you're not able to join arena.\nPlease contact us via facebook page inbox for more information. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \nThank you for your understanding."
      - "캐릭터 데이터가 부정한 방법으로 조작되어 아레나에 참여할 수 없습니다.\n Facebook 페이지를 통해 저희에게 문의해서 더 자세한 내용을 확인하세요.\nfacebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame\n이해해주셔서 감사합니다."
      - "Character data is manipulated illegally then you're not able to join arena.\nPlease contact us via facebook page inbox for more information. facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \nThank you for your understanding."
      - "字符数据受到非法操作，因此你无法进入竞技场。\n欲了解更多信息，请通过Facebook主页收件箱联系我们，主页地址：facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \n 感谢你的谅解。"
      - "字元資料受到非法操作，因此你無法進入競技場。\n欲瞭解更多資訊，請通過Facebook主頁收件箱聯繫我們，主頁地址：facebook.com/ShadowOfDeath.FightingGame \n 感謝你的諒解。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
