    - Term: ASK_FOR_RATE_5_STARS
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Did you enjoy fighting monster in Shadow of Death? Please let us know!
      - Вам понравилось сражаться с монстрами в игре Shadow of Death? Расскажите нам об этом!
      - Você gostou de lutar contra monstros no Shadow of Death? Deixe um comentário!
      - Hạ gục kẻ ác có làm bạn vui khi chơi Shadow of Death? Hãy chia sẻ với chúng tôi!
      - Hattest du Spaß dabei, in Shadow of Death gegen Monster zu kämpfen? Dann lass uns das bitte wissen!
      - Did you enjoy fighting monster in Shadow of Death? Please let us know!
      - Did you enjoy fighting monster in Shadow of Death? Please let us know!
      - Did you enjoy fighting monster in Shadow of Death? Please let us know!
      - Shadow of Deathをお楽しみいただけていますか？ ぜひ評価をお願いします！
      - ท่านสนุกกับการต่อสู้กับมอนสเตอร์ใน Shadow of Death ไหม? โปรดบอกให้เรารู้หน่อย!
      - Did you enjoy fighting monster in Shadow of Death? Please let us know!
      - "Shadow of Death\n에서 몬스터와 싸우는 게 재미있나요? \n저희에게 알려주세요!"
      - Did you enjoy fighting monster in Shadow of Death? Please let us know!
      - 你是否享受在《死亡之影 (Shadow of Death)》中杀戮怪物的快感？请告诉我们！
      - 在《死亡之影（Shadow of Death）》裡，與怪物之間的熱鬥是否讓你盡興？請與我們分享你的心得感想！
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ASK_FOR_RATE_5_STARS_2
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - How would you rate Shadow of Death?
      - Какую оценку вы бы поставили игре Shadow of Death?
      - Como você avaliaria o Shadow of Death?
      - Bạn thấy Shadow of Death thế nào?
