    - Term: ASK_FOR_RATE_POPUP_TIP_1
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Enjoy Shadow of Death? Please take a few minute to give us a 5 star rating!
      - Вам нравится “Тень смерти”? Пожалуйста, уделите нам несколько минут и поставьте 5 звезд нашей игре.
      - Gosta da Sombra da Morte? Por favor reserve alguns minutos para nos avaliar com 5 estrelas!
      - Bạn có hài lòng với Shadow of Death không? Vui lòng bỏ ra 5 phút để đánh giá game nhé!
      - Gefällt dir Shadow of Death? Bitte nimm dir ein paar Minuten Zeit, um uns eine 5-Sterne-Bewertung zu geben!
      - Enjoy Shadow of Death? Please take a few minute to give us a 5 star rating!
      - Aimez-vous Shadow of Death ? Veuillez prendre quelques minutes pour nous donner 5 étoiles !
      - Ti piace Shadow of Death? Prendi un minuto per lasciarci 5 stelle!
      - "Shadow of Deathをお楽しみいただいてますか？\n5つ星評価をお願いします！"
      - สนุกกับเกม Shadow of Death ใช่ไหม? โปรดใช้เวลาชั่วครู่เพื่อให้คะแนนเรา 5 ดาว!
      - Suka Shadow of Death? Tolong minta beberapa menit untuk memberikan kami rating bintang 5!
      - Shadow of Death가 즐거우시다면 저희에게 별 5개를 주세요!
      - Nasiyahan sa Shadow of Death? Mangyaring maglaan ng ilang minuto upang bigyan kami ng isang 5 star na rating!
      - 喜欢《死亡之影（Shadow of Death）》吗！请花费一点时间给我们打个5星好评吧！
      - 喜歡《死亡之影（Shadow of Death）》嗎！請花費一點時間給我們打個5星好評吧！
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
