    - Term: BTN_PRAY_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Receive Pray Buff in [f0b12b]{0}[-] seconds:\n+ [f0b12b]{1}[-] Attack\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Defense\n+ [f0b12b]{3}[-] HP"
      - "Получить усиление Мольба через [f0b12b]{0}[-] секунд:\n + [f0b12b]{1}[-] Атака\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Защита\n + [f0b12b]{3}[-] Здоровье"
      - "Receber Forte Oração em [f0b12b]{0} segundos:[-]\n + [f0b12b]{1}[-] Ataque\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Defesa\n + [f0b12b]{3}[-] HP"
      - "Nhận Ban phước sau [f0b12b]{0}[-] giây:\n+ [f0b12b]{1}[-] Tấn công\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Phòng thủ\n+ [f0b12b]{3}[-] HP"
      - "Erhalte einen Gebetsbuff in [f0b12b]{0}[-] Sekunden:\n + [f0b12b]{1}[-] Angriff\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Abwehr\n + [f0b12b]{3}[-] LP"
      - "Receive Pray Buff in [f0b12b]{0}[-] seconds:\n+ [f0b12b]{1}[-] Attack\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Defense\n+ [f0b12b]{3}[-] HP"
      - "Recevoir Pray Buff dans [f0b12b] {0} [-] secondes : \n+ [f0b12b]{1}[-] Attaque \n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Défense \n+ [f0b12b]{3}[-] HP"
      - "Ricevi Passione Preghiera in [f0b12b]{0}[-] secondi:\n + [f0b12b]{1}[-] Attacco\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Difesa\n + [f0b12b]{3}[-] PV"
      - "[f0b12b]{0}[-]秒でプレイバフを受け取ります:\n+ [f0b12b]{1}[-]攻撃\n + [f0b12b]{2}[-]防御\n + [f0b12b]{3}[-] HP"
      - "รับบัฟสวดภาวนาใน [f0b12b]{0}[-] วินาที:\n + พลังโจมตี [f0b12b]{1}[-]\n + พลังป้องกัน [f0b12b]{2}[-]\n + HP [f0b12b]{3}[-]"
      - "Menerima Buff Doa dalam [f0b12b]{0}[-] detik:\n + [f0b12b]{1}[-] Serangan\n+ [f0b12b]{2}[-] Pertahanan\n + [f0b12b]{3}[-] HP"
