      - "DBA32BFF] Gesegnet anwenden für[98DB51FF]{0}s[-]:\n + Erhöht [98DB51FF]{1}[-] ANG des Ziels.\n + Erhöht[98DB51FF]{2}[-] ABW des Ziels.\n + Heilt [98DB51FF]{3}[-] sofort max. LP des Ziels.[-]"
      - "[DBA32BFF] Apply Blessed for [98DB51FF]{0}s[-]:\n+ Increases [98DB51FF]{1}[-] target's ATK.\n+ Increases [98DB51FF]{2}[-] target's DEF.\n+ Heals [98DB51FF]{3}[-] target's Max HP instantly. [-]"
      - "[DBA32BFF] Apply Blessed for [98DB51FF]{0}s[-]:\n+ Increases [98DB51FF]{1}[-] target's ATK.\n+ Increases [98DB51FF]{2}[-] target's DEF.\n+ Heals [98DB51FF]{3}[-] target's Max HP instantly. [-]"
