    - Term: EQUIPMENT_INVENTORY_FULL
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Your inventory is full. \nTry to [F1AD4DFF]sell[-] your equipment or [F1AD4DFF]expand[-] your inventory."
      - "Ваш инвентарь полон. \n Попробуйте [F1AD4DFF]продать[-] вашу экипировку или [F1AD4DFF]расширить[-] инвентарь!"
      - "O seu inventário está cheio.\n Experimente [F1AD4DFF]vender[-] o seu equipamento ou [F1AD4DFF]expandir[-] o seu inventário."
      - "Túi đồ của bạn đã đầy.\nBạn có thể [F1AD4DFF]bán[-] bớt vật phẩm trong hòm hoặc [F1AD4DFF]mở rộng[-] túi đồ của bạn."
      - "Dein Inventar ist voll. \n [F1AD4DFF]Verkaufe[-] deine Ausrüstung oder [F1AD4DFF]erweitere[-] dein Inventar."
      - "Your inventory is full. \nYou should try to [F1AD4DFF]sell[-] your equipment or [F1AD4DFF]expand[-] your inventory !"
      - "Your inventory is full. \n You should try to [F1AD4DFF]sell[-] your equipment or [F1AD4DFF]expand[-] your inventory !"
      - "Your inventory is full. \n You should try to [F1AD4DFF]sell[-] your equipment or [F1AD4DFF]expand[-] your inventory !"
      - インベントリーがいっぱいですしてみます[F1AD4DFF]売る[-]装備を、もしくは[F1AD4DFF]広げる[-]インベントリーを
      - ช่องเก็บของของคุณเต็มแล้ว ลอง[F1AD4DFF]ขาย[-]อุปกรณ์ของคุณหรือ[F1AD4DFF]ขยาย[-]ช่องเก็บของของคุณ
      - "Inventaris anda penuh.\n Coba [F1AD4DFF]jual[-] perlengkapanmu atau [F1AD4DFF]perluas[-] inventarismu."
      - "인벤토리가 가득 찼습니다. \n장비를 [F1AD4DFF]판매[-]하거나 인벤토리를 [F1AD4DFF]확장[-]하세요."
      - "Ang iyong imbentaryo ay puno na. \n Subukang [F1AD4DFF]ibenta[-] ang iyong kagamitan o [F1AD4DFF]palakihin[-] ang iyong imbentaryo."
      - "你的仓库已满。 \n 尝试 [F1AD4DFF]出售[-] 你的装备或 [F1AD4DFF]扩大[-]仓库。"
      - "你的倉庫已滿。 \n 嘗試 [F1AD4DFF]出售[-] 你的裝備或 [F1AD4DFF]擴大[-]倉庫。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: EQUIPMENT_PASSIVE_SKILL_ALLIN_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, after that reduce [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], last for [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] seconds, active 1 time per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Увеличивает вашу атаку и защиту на [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-], если здоровье составляет [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] или меньше. Длительность: [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] с. После этого снижает [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], длится [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] с. Применяется только 1 раз за бой.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Aumenta o ataque e a defesa em [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] se o PV é [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] ou menor, dura [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] segundos, depois reduz [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], dura [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] segundos, só ativa 1 vez por batalha'
      - '[DBA32BFF] + Tăng khả năng tấn công và phòng thủ của bạn thêm [98DB51FF] {scalePower}% [-] nếu Máu bằng hoặc thấp hơn[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-], kéo dài trong[98DB51FF]{duration}[-] giây, sau làm giảm[98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-, kéo dài trong [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] giây, hoạt động 1 lần mỗi trận'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Erhöht deinen Angriff und deine Abwehr um [98DB51FF]{scalePower} %[-], wenn LP [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold} %[-] oder weniger beträgt. Hält [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] Sekunden, danach Reduktion um [98DB51FF]{scalePower2} %[-] für die Dauer von [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] Sekunden. Nur 1 Mal pro Kampf aktivierbar.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, after that reduce [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], last for [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] seconds, active 1 time per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, after that reduce [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], last for [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] seconds, active 1 time per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, after that reduce [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], last for [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] seconds, active 1 time per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ HPが[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-]以下になると、攻撃力と防御力が[98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]アップ。効果は[98DB51FF]{duration}[-]秒持続。その後、[98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-]ダウンが[98DB51FF]{duration2}[-]秒続く。1回のバトルにつき1度しか発動できない。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ เพิ่มพลังโจมตีและพลังป้องกันขึ้น [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] หากค่า HP มีค่าน้อยกว่า [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] เป็นระยะเวลา [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] วินาที หลังจากนั้นลดค่าพลังลง [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] เป็นระยะเวลา [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] วินาที เปิดใช้งานได้เพียง 1 ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, after that reduce [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], last for [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] seconds, active 1 time per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ HP가 [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] 이하로 내려가면 공격력과 방어력이 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] 상승합니다. 지속시간은 [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]초이며, 이후 [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-]초 동안 [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] 감소합니다. 전투당 한 번만 활성화됩니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, after that reduce [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], last for [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] seconds, active 1 time per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 若生命值小于或等于最大值的[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-]，则攻击力和防御力提高 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]，效果持续 [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] 秒，在那之后减少 [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-]，持续 [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] 秒，每场战斗只能激活一次。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 若生命值小於或等於最大值的[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-]，則攻擊力和防禦力提高 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]，效果持續 [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] 秒，在那之後減少 [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-]，持續 [98DB51FF]{duration2}[-] 秒，每場戰鬥只能啟動一次。'
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
