    - Term: EQUIPMENT_PASSIVE_SKILL_BESTFRIEND_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense to you by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] of Pet''s stats if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Увеличивает вашу атаку и защиту на [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] от параметров питомца, если здоровье составляет [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] или меньше, длится [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] с. Применяется только 1 раз за бой.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Aumenta o seu ataque e defesa em [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] dos atributos da mascote se o PV é [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] ou menor, dura [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] segundos, só ativa 1 vez por batalha'
      - '[DBA32BFF] + Tăng sức tấn công và phòng thủ của bạn bằng giá trị [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] chỉ số của Thú cưng nếu Máu bằng hoặc thấp hơn [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-], kéo dài trong [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] giây, chỉ hoạt động 1 lần cho mỗi trận chiến'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Erhöht deinen Angriff und deine Abwehr um [98DB51FF]{scalePower} %[-] der Werte deines Begleiters, wenn LP [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold} %[-] oder weniger beträgt. Hält [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] Sekunden. Nur 1 Mal pro Kampf aktivierbar.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense to you by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] of Pet''s stats if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense to you by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] of Pet''s stats if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense to you by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] of Pet''s stats if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ HPが[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-]以下になると、ペットの攻撃力と防御力が[98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]アップ。[98DB51FF]{duration}[-]秒持続、1回のバトルにつき1度しか発動できない。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ เพิ่มพลังโจมตีและพลังป้องกันขึ้น [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] จากค่าสถานะของสัตว์เลี้ยง หากค่า HP มีค่าน้อยกว่า [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] เป็นระยะเวลา [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] วินาที เปิดใช้งานได้เพียง 1 ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense to you by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] of Pet''s stats if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ HP가 [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] 이하로 내려가면 당신의 공격력과 방어력이 펫의 능력치의 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]만큼 상승합니다. 지속시간: [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]초. 전투당 한 번만 활성화됩니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack and Defense to you by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] of Pet''s stats if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 若生命值小于或等于最大值的[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-]，则攻击力和防御力提高宠物对应属性的 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] ，持续[98DB51FF]{duration}[-] 秒，每场战斗只能激活一次。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 若生命值小於或等於最大值的[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-]，則攻擊力和防禦力提高寵物對應屬性的 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] ，持續[98DB51FF]{duration}[-] 秒，每場戰鬥只能啟動一次。'
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
