    - Term: EQUIPMENT_PASSIVE_SKILL_BLASTWAVE_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ When talking damage, character has [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] chance to release a blastwave, dealing  [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack as damage. Cooldown  [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ При получении урона персонаж имеет [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] шанс вызова взрывной волны, которая превращает [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] атаки в повреждения. Перезарядка [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (с).'
      - '[DBA32LFB]+ Quando falamos de danos, a personagem tem [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] de oportunidade para liberar uma onda esmagadora, soltando um ataque [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] como dano. Recarga [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF] - Khi nhận sát thương, nhân vật có [98DB51FF] {1}% [-] cơ hội phát ra một vụ nổ, gây sát thương bằng [98DB51FF] {0}% [-] sức tấn công. Hồi chiêu trong [98DB51FF] {2} [-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Bei erlittenem Schaden hat der Charakter eine Chance von [98DB51FF]{1} %[-], eine Explosionswelle zu entfesseln, die [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] Schaden zufügt. Abklingzeit [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF]- When talking damage, character has [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] chance to release a blast wave deals  [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack as damage. Cooldown  [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s)'
      - '[DBA32BFF] + lorsque l''on parle de dommages, le personnage a chance [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] pour libérer une vague de souffle, portant [98DB51FF] {0} % [-] attaque comme dommages. Temps de recharge [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Quando subisce danni, il personaggio ha [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] probabilità di creare un''esplosione, trattando [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attacco come danno. Cooldown [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF] +ダメージを受けるとき、キャラクターは[98DB51FF] {1}％[-]爆発を放ち、[98DB51FF] {0}％[-]攻撃にダメージを与えます。クールダウン[98DB51FF] {2} [-]（秒）。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ เมื่อโจมตีดาเมจ ตัวละครจะมีโอกาส [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] ปล่อยคลื่นระเบิด ทำให้การโจมตี [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] กลายเป็นดาเมจ เวลาคูลดาวน์ [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (วินาที)'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Ketika menerima damage, karakter memiliki [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] peluang untuk melepaskan gelombang ledakan, memberikan [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] serangan sebagai damage. Cooldown [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 피해를 입을 때, [98DB51FF]{1}%[-]의 확률로 돌풍을 날려[98DB51FF]{0}%[-]의 피해를 줍니다. 재사용 대기시간 [98DB51FF]{2}[-]초.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Kapag nakakatanggap ng pinsala, ang karakter ay may [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] pagkakataong maglabas ng blastwave, at kilalanin ang [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] na atake bilang pinsala. Cooldown [98DB51FF]{2}[-] (s).'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 受到伤害时，角色有[98DB51FF]{1}%[-] 的几率释放出爆破波， 使攻击伤害值提高[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 。冷却时间 [98DB51FF]{2}[-] （秒）。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 受到傷害時，角色有[98DB51FF]{1}%[-] 的幾率釋放出爆破波， 使攻擊傷害值提高[98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 。冷卻時間 [98DB51FF]{2}[-] （秒）。'
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
