      - '[DBA32BFF]- When talking damage, character has [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-] chance to release a blast wave deals  [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] attack as damage. Cooldown  [98DB51FF]{cooldown}[-] (s)'
