      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Увеличивает вашу атаку и защиту на [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-], когда вы переходите в режим рейда, длится [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] с. Применяется только 1 раз за бой.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Aumenta o ataque em [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] e a defesa em [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] ao entrar no modo de raide, dura [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] segundos, só ativa 1 vez por batalha'
      - '[DBA32BFF] + Tăng sức tấn công của bạn [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] và Phòng thủ [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] khi tham gia Chế độ Phá Huỷ, kéo dài trong [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] giây, chỉ hoạt động 1 lần cho mỗi trận chiến'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Erhöht deinen Angriff um [98DB51FF]{scalePower} %[-] und deine Abwehr um [98DB51FF]{scalePower2} %[-], wenn du in den Raid-Modus gehst. Hält [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] Sekunden. Nur 1 Mal pro Kampf aktivierbar.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] when join in Raid Mode, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] when join in Raid Mode, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] when join in Raid Mode, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ レイドモードに参加時、攻撃力が[98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]、防御力が[98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-]アップ。[98DB51FF]{duration}[-]秒持続、1回のバトルにつき1度しか発動できない。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ เพิ่มพลังโจมตี [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] และเพิ่มพลังป้องกัน [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] ขณะเข้าร่วมในโหมดจู่โจม เป็นระยะเวลา [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] วินาที เปิดใช้งานได้เพียง 1 ครั้งต่อการต่อสู้'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] when join in Raid Mode, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 레이드 모드에 들어갈 때 공격력은 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]만큼, 방어력은 [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-]만큼 상승합니다. 지속시간: [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]초. 전투당 한 번만 활성화됩니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase your Attack by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] and Defense by [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] when join in Raid Mode, last for [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]seconds, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 当你进入突袭模式时，攻击力提高 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]，防御力提高 [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] ，持续时间为 [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]秒，每场战斗只能激活一次。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 當你進入突襲模式時，攻擊力提高 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]，防禦力提高 [98DB51FF]{scalePower2}%[-] ，持續時間為 [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]秒，每場戰鬥只能啟動一次。'
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
