      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Has [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-] chance to increase Skill Damage by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] attack each time you use skill in [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Has [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-] chance to increase Skill Damage by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] attack each time you use skill in [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-]の確率で、スキルを使用するたびにスキルダメージが[98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]アップ。[98DB51FF]{duration}[-]秒有効。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ มีโอกาส [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-] ที่จะเพิ่มดาเมจของสกิลขึ้น [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] ของพลังโจมตีในทุกครั้งที่คุณใช้สกิล เป็นเวลา [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] วินาที'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Has [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-] chance to increase Skill Damage by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] attack each time you use skill in [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ [98DB51FF]{duration}[-]초 안에 스킬을 사용할 때마다 [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-]의 확률로 스킬 데미지가 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]만큼 상승합니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Has [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-] chance to increase Skill Damage by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] attack each time you use skill in [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] seconds.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 每次使用技能时有 [98DB51FF]{successRate}%[-] 的几率提高 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] 攻击力的技能伤害值，持续时间为 [98DB51FF]{duration}[-] 秒。'
