    - Term: EQUIPMENT_PASSIVE_SKILL_NATURALHEALING_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Recover [98DB51FF]{hpPercent}%[-] HP if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Восстанавливает здоровье в размере [98DB51FF]{hpPercent}%[-], если здоровье составляет [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] или меньше.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Recupera [98DB51FF]{hpPercent}%[-] de PV se o PV é [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] ou menor, só ativa 1 vez por batalha.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] + Khôi phục [98DB51FF]{hpPercent}%[-] Máu nếu Máu bằng hoặc thấp hơn [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-], chỉ hoạt động 1 lần cho mỗi trận chiến'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Stellt [98DB51FF]{hpPercent} %[-] LP wieder her, wenn LP [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold} %[-] oder weniger beträgt. Nur 1 Mal pro Kampf aktivierbar.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Recover [98DB51FF]{hpPercent}%[-] HP if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, active 1 time only per battle'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Recover [98DB51FF]{hpPercent}%[-] HP if HP is [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] or less, active 1 time only per battle'
