    - Term: EQUIPMENT_PASSIVE_SKILL_RAGE_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase attack power by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] for each [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] HP you lost, this attack power will be reduced if your HP is recover.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Увеличивает силу атаки на [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] для каждых [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] потерянного здоровья.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Aumenta o poder de ataque em [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] para cada [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] de PV perdido, o poder desse ataque será reduzido se o PV for recuperado.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] + Tăng sức tấn công lên [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] cho mỗi [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] Máu bạn bị mất, sức tấn công này sẽ bị giảm nếu HP của bạn được phục hồi.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Erhöht die Angriffskraft um [98DB51FF]{scalePower} %[-] für jede verlorene [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold} %[-] LP. Die Angriffskraft wird reduziert, wenn deine LP wiederhergestellt wurde.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase attack power by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] for each [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] HP you lost, this attack power will be reduced if your HP is recover.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase attack power by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] for each [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] HP you lost, this attack power will be reduced if your HP is recover.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase attack power by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] for each [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] HP you lost, this attack power will be reduced if your HP is recover.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ HPを[98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] 失うたびに攻撃力が[98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]アップ。HPを回復すると攻撃力は元に戻る。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ เพิ่มพลังโจมตี [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] ต่อทุกค่า HP [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] ที่ท่านสูญเสียไป พลังโจมตีจะลดลงหากค่า HP ของท่านเพิ่มขึ้น'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase attack power by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] for each [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] HP you lost, this attack power will be reduced if your HP is recover.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] HP를 잃을 때마다 공격력이 [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-]만큼 상승합니다. 이렇게 상승한 공격력은 HP가 회복되면 감소됩니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Increase attack power by [98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] for each [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] HP you lost, this attack power will be reduced if your HP is recover.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 每损失 [98DB51FF]{hpThreshold}%[-] 的生命值，你的攻击力就能提高[98DB51FF]{scalePower}%[-] ，但增加的攻击力会随着生命值恢复而下降。'
