      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Komboangriff hat eine Chance von [98DB51FF]{1} %[-], eine kleine Schockwelle zu entfesseln, die [98DB51FF]{0} %[-] Schaden zufügt.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]- Combo attack has [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] to release a small shock wave deals [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attack as damage'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Combo attaque a [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] pour libérer une petite onde de choc, portant [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] attaque comme dommage.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Attacco combinato con [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] di emettere una piccola onda d''urto, trattando [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] di attacco come danno.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] +コンボアタックでは[98DB51FF] {1}％[-]の小さな衝撃波が発生し、[98DB51FF] {0}％[-]攻撃がダメージを与えます。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ การโจมตีคอมโบ[98DB51FF]{1}%[-]เพื่อปล่อยคลื่นกระแทกจำนวนเล็กน้อย ทำให้การโจมตี [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] กลายเป็นดาเมจ'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+Serangan kombo [98DB51FF]{1}%[-]untuk melepaskan gelombang kejut kecil, memberikan [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] serangan sebagai damage.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 콤보 어택이 [98DB51FF]{1}%[-]의 확률로 충격파를 발사하여 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-]의 피해를 줍니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ Ang pinagsamang atake ay may [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] upang makapaglabas ng maliit na shockwave, at kilalanin ang [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] atake bilang pinsala.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 连续攻击有 [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] 的几率释放出小型冲击波，使攻击伤害值提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]+ 連續攻擊有 [98DB51FF]{1}%[-] 的幾率釋放出小型衝擊波，使攻擊傷害值提高 [98DB51FF]{0}%[-] 。'
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
