    - Term: HELL_MODE_FIRST_WARNING_CONTENT
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "- You can recover them by beating the same dungeon where you drop them.\n- You can have maximum of [F1AD4DFF]3 defeated graves[-] at a time.\n- Defeated in a 4th dungeon will result in losing all of your lost souls in the 1st dungeon, forever."
      - "- Вы можете вернуть их, пройдя то же подземелье, где вы их потеряли.\n- Вы можете пройти не более [F1AD4DFF]3 подземелий[-] за один раз.\n - При прохождении 4-го подземелья вы навсегда потеряете все души, полученные в первом подземелье."
      - "- Você pode recuperá-las se concluir a mesma masmorra onde foram perdidas.\n- Você pode ter até [F1AD4DFF]3 túmulos de fracasso[-] por vez.\n- Você perderá todas as almas, para sempre, se for derrotado pela quarta vez."
      - "- Chết sẽ để lại một Ngôi Mộ chứa toàn bộ Soul đã mất\n- Chiến thắng tại màn đã thua để lấy lại số Soul đã mất\n- Tối đa bạn có [F1AD4DFF]3 Ngôi Mộ chứa Soul [-] cùng lúc\n- Ngôi Mộ thứ 4 sẽ làm mất toàn bộ số Soul của Ngôi Mộ đầu tiên"
      - "- Du kannst sie wiederherstellen, indem du den gleichen Dungeon schaffst, in dem du sie verloren hast.\n - Du kannst maximal[F1AD4DFF]3 besiegte Gräber[-] gleichzeitig haben.\n - Wirst du in einem 4. Dungeon besiegt, verlierst du all deine im 1. Dungeon verlorenen Seelen dauerhaft."
      - "- You can recover them by beating the same dungeon where you drop them.\n- You can have maximum of [F1AD4DFF]3 defeated graves[-] at a time.\n- Defeated in a 4th dungeon will result in losing all of your lost souls in the 1st dungeon, forever."
      - "- You can recover them by beating the same dungeon where you drop them.\n- You can have maximum of [F1AD4DFF]3 defeated graves[-] at a time.\n- Defeated in a 4th dungeon will result in losing all of your lost souls in the 1st dungeon, forever."
      - "- You can recover them by beating the same dungeon where you drop them.\n- You can have maximum of [F1AD4DFF]3 defeated graves[-] at a time.\n- Defeated in a 4th dungeon will result in losing all of your lost souls in the 1st dungeon, forever."
      - "- 失ったのと同じダンジョンをクリアできれば、回収できる\n- [F1AD4DFF]敗れた場合の墓は最大3個[-]まで存在できる\n- つまり4回ダンジョンで敗れてしまうと、1回目のダンジョンで得たソウルはもう二度と取り戻すことができない"
      - "- ท่านสามารถรับดวงวิญญาณคืนได้จากการเอาชนะดันเจี้ยนเดียวกันกับที่ท่านเสียดวงวิญญาณไป\n- ท่านจะมี[F1AD4DFF]หลุมศพแห่งความพ่ายแพ้ได้สูงสุด 3 หลุม[-]\n - การพ่ายแพ้ในดันเจี้ยนที่ 4 จะทำให้ท่านสูญเสียดวงวิญญาณทั้งหมดที่ท่านเสียไปในดันเจี้ยนที่ 1 ไปตลอดกาล"
      - "- You can recover them by beating the same dungeon where you drop them.\n- You can have maximum of [F1AD4DFF]3 defeated graves[-] at a time.\n- Defeated in a 4th dungeon will result in losing all of your lost souls in the 1st dungeon, forever."
      - "- 물건을 떨어뜨린 던전을 완료하면 떨어뜨린 물건을 다시 찾을 수 있습니다.\n- [F1AD4DFF]패배 무덤은 한 번에 최대 3개까지[-]을 보유할 수 있습니다.\n- 4번째 던전에서 패배하면 첫 번째 던전에서 잃은 영혼이 전부 영원히 사라집니다."
      - "- You can recover them by beating the same dungeon where you drop them.\n- You can have maximum of [F1AD4DFF]3 defeated graves[-] at a time.\n- Defeated in a 4th dungeon will result in losing all of your lost souls in the 1st dungeon, forever."
      - "- 通关同一个地下城可以取回你之前掉落的灵魂。\n- 你一次最多只能拥有[F1AD4DFF]3个被击败的坟墓[-]。\n- 如果你在第4个地下城中被击败，你将永久失去所有在第1个地下城中失去的灵魂。"
      - "- 只要將原先你失去靈魂的地下城打通，就能取回這些靈魂。\n- 你一次最多可保有 [F1AD4DFF]3 個曾遭擊敗的墓穴[-]。\n- 在第 4 個地下城落敗時，將導致第 1 個地下城內所失去的靈魂永久消失。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
