      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]You have reached your defeated dungeon limit[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]Вы достигли предела пройденных подземелий[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]Você alcançou o seu limite de derrotas de masmorra[-]'
