      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]You have reached your defeated dungeon limit[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]You have reached your defeated dungeon limit[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]You have reached your defeated dungeon limit[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]ダンジョン敗北数上限に到達[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]ท่านได้ถึงขีดจำกัดจำนวนดันเจี้ยนที่พ่ายแพ้แล้ว[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]You have reached your defeated dungeon limit[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]던전 패배 제한에 도달했습니다.[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]You have reached your defeated dungeon limit[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]你已达到地下城被击败次数上限[-]'
      - '[b][F1AD4DFF]你已達到落敗地下城的上限[-]'
