    - Term: NOTIFICATION__SHOP_AND_IAP__REFRESHED_VENDOR_SHOP_MESSAGE
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Just a quick merch update, because we have new items in our shop! \nCheck out these awesome new arrivals!"
      - Проверьте новое великолепное поступление!
      - "Apenas uma rápida atualização de merchandising, porque temos novos itens na nossa loja!\n Confira essas incríveis novidades!"
      - "Tiệm hàng rong chúng tôi mới nhập thêm rất nhiều vật phẩm giá trị!\nĐừng bỏ lỡ!"
      - "Nur ein schnelles Update, wir haben neue Gegenstände in unserem Shop! \nSchau dir diese tollen Neuwaren an!"
      - "Just a quick merch update, because we have new items in our shop! \nCheck out these awesome new arrivals!"
      - "Juste une mise à jour rapide, parce que nous avons de nouveaux articles dans notre magasin ! \nDécouvrez ces supers nouveaux arrivants !"
      - "Solo un rapido aggiornamento, perché nel nostro negozio ci sono nuovi arrivi! \n Scopri questi meravigliosi nuovi arrivi!"
      - 新しい商品がありますので商品アップデートをクリックしてください！
      - "อัปเดตรายการสินค้าด่วน เพราะว่าเรามีสินค้าใหม่มานำเสนอในร้านค้าของเรา! \n ไปดูสินค้าใหม่สุดเจ๋งเหล่านี้กันเถอะ!"
      - "Hanya update jualan singkat, karena kami memiliki barang baru di toko kami!\nCek barang baru yang keren ini!"
      - 상점에 새로운 아이템을 추가하는 간단한 상점 업데이트입니다! 새롭게 입고된 멋진 아이템을 확인하세요!
      - "Isang mabilis na update tungkol sa paninda, dahil mayroon kaming mga bagong item sa aming tindahan!\n Tingnan ang mga kahanga-hangang bagong dating na ito!"
      - "你需要进行一次快速的商品更新，因为我们的商店上新啦！ \n 看看这些令人惊叹的新品吧！"
      - "你需要進行一次快速的商品更新，因為我們的商店上新啦！ \n 看看這些令人驚歎的新品吧！"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
