    - Term: PET_1001_SKILL_1_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Bleeding to target, causing damage over time."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Наносит физический урон ([98DB51FF]100%[-] от силы атаки). \n С небольшим шансом может наложить на цель эффект «Кровопускание», который наносит длительный урон."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Causa ([98DB51FF]100%[-] de poder de ataque) dano físico. \nTem uma pequena chance de causar sangramento no alvo, causando dano ao longo do tempo."
      - '[DBA32BFF]Gây ra ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương vật lý. Có tỉ lệ nhỏ gây Xuất Huyết, khiến kẻ địch bị chảy máu trong một khoảng thời gian.'
      - "[DBA32BFF]Verursacht ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) physischen Schaden. \n Hat eine geringe Chance, dem Ziel Blutungen zuzufügen, die im Laufe der Zeit zu Schäden führen."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Bleeding to target, causing damage over time."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Bleeding to target, causing damage over time."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Bleeding to target, causing damage over time."
      - '[DBA32BFF]物理ダメージ（攻撃力の[98DB51FF]100%[-]）を与える。 少ないが対象に流血状態を付与できる確率を持ち、時間の経過とともにダメージを与える。'
      - "[DBA32BFF]สร้างดาเมจทางกายภาพ ( [98DB51FF]100%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) \n มีโอกาสเล็กน้อยที่จะทำให้เป้าหมายติดสถานะเลือดออก และสร้างความเสียหายแบบต่อเนื่อง"
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Bleeding to target, causing damage over time."
      - "[DBA32BFF]물리 데미지(공격력의 [98DB51FF]100%[-])를 입힙니다.\n 적은 확률로 목표물에게 출혈을 일으켜서 일정 시간 동안 데미지를 입힙니다."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Bleeding to target, causing damage over time."
      - "[DBA32BFF]造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻击力）物理伤害。 \n 有较小几率对目标施加流血状态，使目标持续受到伤害。"
      - "[DBA32BFF]造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻擊力）物理傷害。 \n 有較小幾率對目標施加流血狀態，使目標持續受到傷害。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
