    - Term: PET_1001_SKILL_2_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]Baby Queen throws her web into enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and cause Stun'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Малышка-королева бросает свою сеть во врагов, наносит волшебный урон ([98DB51FF]100%[-] от силы атаки) и накладывает эффект оглушения.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]A Rainha Bebê joga suas teias nos inimigos, causando ([98DB51FF]100%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico e causando atordoamento'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Baby Queen phóng kén nhện, làm choáng kẻ địch đầu tiên trúng phải, đồng thời gây ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương phép.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Die Babykönigin schießt ihr Netz auf Gegner, fügt ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden und Betäuben zu'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Baby Queen throws her web into enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Baby Queen throws her web into enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Baby Queen throws her web into enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]ベイビークイーンが敵に向かってクモの巣を投げ、魔法ダメージ（攻撃力の[98DB51FF]100%[-]）を与え、スタン状態にする'
      - '[DBA32BFF]ตัวอ่อนราชินีปล่อยใยของเธอใส่ศัตรู พร้อมกับสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]100%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) ดาเมจเวทมนตร์และทำให้ติดสถานะมึนงง'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Baby Queen throws her web into enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]새끼 퀸이 적들에게 거미줄을 투척해서 마법 데미지(공격력의 [98DB51FF]100%[-])를 입힙니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Baby Queen throws her web into enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]宝贝女王向敌人掷出蛛网，造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害并引起眩晕状态'
      - '[DBA32BFF]寶貝女王向敵人擲出蛛網，造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻擊力）魔法傷害並引起眩暈狀態'
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
