    - Term: PET_2001_SKILL_1_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to reduce target's armor."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Наносит физический урон ([98DB51FF]100%[-] от силы атаки). \n С небольшим шансом может снизить защиту цели."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Causa ([98DB51FF]100%[-] de poder de ataque) dano físico. \nTem uma pequena chance de reduzir a armadura do inimigo."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gây ra([98DB51FF]100%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương vật lý.\nCó tỉ lệ nhỏ xuyên giáp mục tiêu"
      - "[DBA32BFF]Verursacht ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) physischen Schaden. \n Hat eine geringe Chance, die Rüstung des Ziels zu reduzieren."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to reduce target's armor."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to reduce target's armor."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to reduce target's armor."
      - '[DBA32BFF]物理ダメージ（攻撃力の[98DB51FF]100%[-]）を与える。 対象の防具の効果を減少する可能性は少ない。'
      - "[DBA32BFF]สร้าง (พลังโจมตี [98DB51FF]100%[-]) ดาเมจทางกายภาพ \n มีโอกาสเล็กน้อยที่จะลดเกราะของศัตรู"
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to reduce target's armor."
      - "[DBA32BFF]물리 데미지(공격력의 [98DB51FF]100%[-])를 입힙니다.\n 적은 확률로 목표물의 갑옷을 약화시킵니다."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage. \nHas a small chance to reduce target's armor."
      - "[DBA32BFF]造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻击力）物理伤害。 \n 有较小几率减少目标的防具值。"
      - "[DBA32BFF]造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻擊力）物理傷害。 \n 有較小幾率減少目標的防具值。"
