    - Term: PET_2006_SKILL_2_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gargoyle turns himself into stone and smashes into the ground, \ncause Stun and deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage to enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Горгулья превращается в камень и бьет по земле, \n при этом накладывает эффект оглушения и наносит физический урон врагам ([98DB51FF]100%[-] от силы атаки)."
      - "[DBA32BFF]O Gárgula se transforma em pedra e golpeia o chão, \n causando atordoamento e ([98DB51FF]100%[-] de poder de ataque) dano físico aos inimigos."
      - "[DBA32BFF] Gargoyle biến mình thành đá và đập xuống đất,\nlàm choáng và gây sát thương ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương vật lý lên kẻ địch."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Der Gargoyle verwandelt sich in Stein, schlägt auf den Boden auf, \n fügt Gegnern Betäubung zu und verursacht ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) physischen Schaden."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gargoyle turns himself into stone and smashes into the ground, \nknockback and deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage to enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gargoyle turns himself into stone and smashes into the ground, \nknockback and deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage to enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gargoyle turns himself into stone and smashes into the ground, \nknockback and deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage to enemies."
      - '[DBA32BFF]ガーゴイルは自分自身を石に変え、地面に衝突し、 敵を後方に飛ばして、物理ダメージ（攻撃力の[98DB51FF]100%[-]）を与え、スタン状態にもする。'
      - "[DBA32BFF]การ์กอยล์แปลงร่างเป็นหินพร้อมกับทิ้งตัวลงสู่พื้นดิน\nทำให้ติดสถานะมึนงงและ [DBA32BFF]สร้างดาเมจทางกายภาพ ( [98DB51FF]100%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) ใส่เหล่าศัตรู"
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gargoyle turns himself into stone and smashes into the ground, \nknockback and deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage to enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]가고일이 돌로 변해서 스스로 땅에 추락합니다.\n 적을 밀어내고 적에게 물리 데미지(공격력의 [98DB51FF]100%[-])를 입힙니다."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gargoyle turns himself into stone and smashes into the ground, \nknockback and deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Physical damage to enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]石像鬼把自己变成一块石头并砸入地面， \n 引发眩晕状态，同时对敌人造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻击力）物理伤害。"
      - "[DBA32BFF]石像鬼把自己變成一塊石頭並砸入地面， \n 引發眩暈狀態，同時對敵人造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻擊力）物理傷害。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
