    - Term: PET_3001_SKILL_1_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Movespeed Down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Наносит волшебный урон ([98DB51FF]100%[-] от силы атаки). \n С небольшим шансом может наложить на цель эффект снижения скорости перемещения."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Causa ([98DB51FF]100%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico. \nTem uma pequena chance de causar lentidão no alvo."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Gây ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương phép.\nMục tiêu bị Quả Cầu Băng sát thương bị làm chậm tốc độ di chuyển."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Verursacht ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden. \n Hat eine geringe Chance, dem Ziel Bewegungstempo-Herabsetzung zuzufügen."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Movespeed Down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Movespeed Down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Movespeed Down to target."
      - '[DBA32BFF]魔法ダメージ（攻撃力の[98DB51FF]100%[-]）を与える。 少ないが対象の移動速度を低下させる確率を持つ。'
      - "[DBA32BFF]สร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]100%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) \n มีโอกาสเล็กน้อยที่จะลดความเร็วในการเคลื่อนที่ของเป้าหมาย"
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Movespeed Down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]마법 데미지(공격력의 [98DB51FF]100%[-])를 입힙니다. \n 적은 확률로 목표물의 이동 속도를 감소시킵니다."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage. \nHas a small chance to apply Movespeed Down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害。 \n 有较小几率对目标施加减速状态。"
      - "[DBA32BFF]造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻擊力）魔法傷害。 \n 有較小幾率對目標施加減速狀態。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: PET_3001_SKILL_1_NAME
