    - Term: PET_3001_SKILL_2_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[DBA32BFF]Baby Wyvern unleashes a mighty energy in front of her, dealing ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Attack power) Magical damage to any enemy unit it collides.\nHas a small chance to apply Cold Burn, causing damage overtime and slow down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Малышка-виверна выпускает перед собой мощную энергию, нанося волшебный урон ([98DB51FF]100%[-] от силы атаки) любому врагу, который сталкивается с ней.\n С небольшим шансом может наложить эффект «Холодный взрыв», который наносит длительный урон и замедляет цель."
      - "[DBA32BFF]O Bebê Serpe solta uma energia poderosa na sua frente, causando ([98DB51FF]100%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico a qualquer unidade inimiga com a qual colidir.\n Tem uma chance pequena de causar queimadura de frio, causando dano ao longo do tempo e diminuindo a velocidade do alvo."
      - '[DBA32BFF]Wyvern Baby giải phóng năng lượng phu ra một quả cầu băng gây ([98DB51FF] 100% [-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương phép khi va chạm với các mục tiêu. Có tỉ lệ nhỏ gây ra hiệu ứng Băng Huyết, khiến mục tiêu bị làm chậm và mất máu theo thời gian.'
      - "[DBA32BFF]Das Lindwurmbaby entfesselt eine mächtige Energie und verursacht ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden bei jedem Gegner, der davon getroffen wird.\n Hat eine geringe Chance, dem Ziel Kaltverbrennung zuzufügen, was im Laufe der Zeit zu Schäden führt und das Ziel verlangsamt."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Baby Wyvern unleashes a mighty energy in front of her, dealing ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Attack power) Magical damage to any enemy unit it collides.\nHas a small chance to apply Cold Burn, causing damage overtime and slow down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Baby Wyvern unleashes a mighty energy in front of her, dealing ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Attack power) Magical damage to any enemy unit it collides.\nHas a small chance to apply Cold Burn, causing damage overtime and slow down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Baby Wyvern unleashes a mighty energy in front of her, dealing ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Attack power) Magical damage to any enemy unit it collides.\nHas a small chance to apply Cold Burn, causing damage overtime and slow down to target."
      - '[DBA32BFF]ベイビーワイバーンが目の前で強力なエネルギーを解き放ち、敵ユニットに魔法ダメージ（[98DB51FF] 100％[-] 攻撃力）を与える。 少ないが対象に低温火傷を付与できる確率を持ち、時間の経過とともにダメージを与える。'
      - "[DBA32BFF]ตัวอ่อนไวเวิร์นปลดปล่อยพลังงานที่รุนแรงออกไปด้านหน้า พร้อมกับ[DBA32BFF]สร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]100%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) ใส่ศัตรูทุกตัวที่โดนโจมตี\nมีโอกาสเล็กน้อยที่จะทำให้ศัตรูติดสถานะน้ำแข็งกัด พร้อมกับสร้างความเสียหายอย่างต่อเนื่อง และลดความเร็วของเป้าหมายลง"
      - "[DBA32BFF]Baby Wyvern unleashes a mighty energy in front of her, dealing ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Attack power) Magical damage to any enemy unit it collides.\nHas a small chance to apply Cold Burn, causing damage overtime and slow down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]새끼 와이번이 전방에 강력한 에너지를 퍼부어서 충돌하는 모든 적들에게 마법 데미지(공격력의 [98DB51FF]100%[-])를 입힙니다.\n 적은 확률로 동상을 일으켜서 목표물에게 일정 시간 동안 데미지를 입히고 움직임 속도를 감소시킵니다."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Baby Wyvern unleashes a mighty energy in front of her, dealing ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Attack power) Magical damage to any enemy unit it collides.\nHas a small chance to apply Cold Burn, causing damage overtime and slow down to target."
      - "[DBA32BFF]小飞龙向前方释放出一股强大的能量，对与其相撞的任何敌人造成 （[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害。\n有较小几率对目标施加冻伤状态，使目标持续失血并减速。"
      - "[DBA32BFF]小飛龍向前方釋放出一股強大的能量，對與其相撞的任何敵人造成 （[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻擊力）魔法傷害。\n有較小幾率對目標施加凍傷狀態，使目標持續失血並減速。"
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
