    - Term: PET_75001_SKILL_2_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF] Create an Ice Hail, deals ([98DB51FF]40%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each attack and cause Freeze.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Создает Ледяной ливень, наносит волшебный урон ([98DB51FF]40%[-] от силы атаки) при каждой атаке и накладывает эффект Замораживание.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Cria uma chuva de gelo, causando ([98DB51FF]40%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico em cada ataque e causa congelamento.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Triệu hồi một cơn mưa băng gây ([98DB51FF]40%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương Phép Thuật và đóng băng mục tiêu.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Erzeugt einen Eishagel, verursacht ([98DB51FF]40 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden bei jedem Angriff und bewirkt Einfrieren.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Create an Ice Hail, deals ([98DB51FF]80%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each attack and cause Freeze.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Create an Ice Hail, deals ([98DB51FF]80%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each attack and cause Freeze.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Create an Ice Hail, deals ([98DB51FF]80%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each attack and cause Freeze.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]氷雹を作り、攻撃ごとに魔法ダメージ（[98DB51FF]攻撃力の80％[-]）を与え、フリーズさせる。'
      - '[DBA32BFF] สร้างฝนลูกเห็บน้ำแข็ง พร้อมกับสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]40%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) ต่อการโจมตีแต่ละครั้ง และทำให้ติดสถานะแช่แข็ง'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Create an Ice Hail, deals ([98DB51FF]80%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each attack and cause Freeze.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]우박을 떨어뜨려 마법 데미지(공격력의 [98DB51FF]80%[-])를 입히고 동결 상태로 만듭니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Create an Ice Hail, deals ([98DB51FF]80%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each attack and cause Freeze.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] 制造冰雹，每次攻击造成（[98DB51FF]40%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害，并引发冻结状态。'
      - '[DBA32BFF] 製造冰雹，每次攻擊造成（[98DB51FF]40%[-] 攻擊力）魔法傷害，並引發凍結狀態。'
