    - Term: PET_75006_SKILL_2_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]Call out Void Eater to attack enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]600%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and has chance to caused Shock and make enemies''s Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Призывает Поедателя пустоты, который атакует врагов, наносит магический урон ([98DB51FF]600%[-] от силы атаки) и с определенным шансом может наложить шок и снизить защиту врагов.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Chama o Devorador do Submundo para atacar os inimigos, causando ([98DB51FF]600%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico com chance de eletrificar e reduzir a defesa.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Gọi Lỗ Đen Hư Không để tấn công kẻ thù, gây ([98DB51FF]600%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương Phép Thuật và có cơ hội gây Sốc giảm giáp kẻ địch.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Ruft den Leere-Fresser herbei, um Gegner anzugreifen, verursacht ([98DB51FF]600 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden und hat die Chance, Schock zu verursachen und die ABW der Gegner zu verringern.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Call out Void Eater to attack enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]600%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and has chance to caused Shock and make enemies''s Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Call out Void Eater to attack enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]600%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and has chance to caused Shock and make enemies''s Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Call out Void Eater to attack enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]600%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and has chance to caused Shock and make enemies''s Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]イーターを召喚して敵を攻撃し、魔法ダメージ(攻撃力の[98DB51FF]600%[-])を付与し、一定の確率でショックを与え、敵の防御を下げる。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]เรียกวอยด์อีตเตอร์เพื่อเข้าโจมตีใส่เหล่าศัตรู สร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]600%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) และมีโอกาสที่จะทำให้ศัตรูติดสถานะช็อตไฟฟ้า และลดค่าพลังป้องกันของศัตรูลง'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Call out Void Eater to attack enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]600%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and has chance to caused Shock and make enemies''s Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]공허 포식자를 불러내, 마법 피해(공격력의 [98DB51FF]600%[-])를 입히고 일정 확률로 충격과 방어력 감소 효과를 적용합니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Call out Void Eater to attack enemies, deals ([98DB51FF]600%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and has chance to caused Shock and make enemies''s Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]召唤虚无吞食兽出来攻击敌人，造成（[98DB51FF]600%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害，并有机会引发震惊状态，降低敌人的防御力。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]召喚虛無吞食獸出來攻擊敵人，造成（[98DB51FF]600%[-] 攻擊力）魔法傷害，並有機會引發震驚狀態，降低敵人的防禦力。'
