      - '[DBA32BFF]Mächtiger Atemhauch, verursacht ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden und senkt die Abwehr.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful breath that deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful breath that deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Def down.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful breath that deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Def down.'
