    - Term: PET_75009_SKILL_2_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]Spit out many venom drop to deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Stun on enemies.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Выплевывает множество капель яда, наносит магический урон ([98DB51FF]100%[-] от силы атаки) при каждом попадании и накладывает на врагов эффект оглушения.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Cospe várias gotas de veneno que causam ([98DB51FF]100%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico em cada acerto e atordoa os inimigos.'
      - '[DBA32BFF] Nhổ ra nhiều nọc độc để gây ra ([98DB51FF]100%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương phép thuật mỗi đòn đánh và gây choáng cho kẻ thù.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Spuckt Gifttropfen, die mit jedem Treffer ([98DB51FF]100 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden und Betäuben bei den Gegnern verursachen.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Spit out many venom drop to deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Stun on enemies.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Spit out many venom drop to deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Stun on enemies.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Spit out many venom drop to deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Stun on enemies.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]毒を大量に降らせ、ヒットするたびに魔法ダメージ(攻撃力の[98DB51FF]100%[-])を付与し、さらに敵をスタンさせる。'
      - '[DBA32BFF] ยิงพิษร้ายมากมายออกไป พร้อมกับสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]100%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) ต่อการโจมตีแต่ละครั้ง และทำให้เหล่าศัตรูติดสถานะมึนงง'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Spit out many venom drop to deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Stun on enemies.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]타격 횟수에 따라 마법 피해(공격력의 [98DB51FF]100%[-])를 입히고 적을 기절시키는 맹독 덩어리를 다수 내뱉습니다.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Spit out many venom drop to deals ([98DB51FF]100%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Stun on enemies.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]吐出许多毒液滴，每次攻击都会造成（[98DB51FF]100%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害，并使敌人陷入晕眩状态。'
