    - Term: PET_75011_SKILL_1_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful flame that deals ([98DB51FF]180%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Мощная огненная атака, которая наносит магический урон ([98DB51FF]180%[-] от силы атаки), накладывает горение и увеличивает получаемый урон.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Uma chama poderosa que causa ([98DB51FF]180%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico, causa imolação e aumenta o dano recebido.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Ngọn lửa phun trào gây ra ([98DB51FF]180%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương phép thuật kèm theo hiệu ứng thiêu đốt mục tiêu'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Mächtige Flamme, die ([98DB51FF]180 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden zufügt, Brennen verursacht und den erlittenen Schaden erhöht.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful flame that deals ([98DB51FF]180%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful flame that deals ([98DB51FF]180%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful flame that deals ([98DB51FF]180%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]強力な炎を放って魔法ダメージ(攻撃力の[98DB51FF]180%[-])を敵に与える＆火傷効果を付与する(被ダメージ量を増やす)'
      - '[DBA32BFF] เพลิงอันทรงพลังที่จะสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]180%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) ทำให้ติดสถานะเผาไหม้ และเพิ่มดาเมจที่ได้รับ'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful flame that deals ([98DB51FF]180%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]마법 데미지를 입히고 (공격력의 [98DB51FF]180%[-]) 화상을 유발하는 화염. 받는 데미지 상승.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Powerful flame that deals ([98DB51FF]180%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]猛烈的火焰，造成（[98DB51FF]180%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害，造成灼伤效果并提高受到的伤害。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]強力火焰，可造成（[98DB51FF]180%[-] 攻擊力）魔法傷害，會產生燃燒效果並提升傷害值。'
