    - Term: PET_75011_SKILL_2_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '[DBA32BFF]Create three eruption of fire that deals ([98DB51FF]20%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Создает три огненных извержения, которые наносят магический урон ([98DB51FF]20%[-] от силы атаки) за каждый удар, накладывают горение и увеличивают получаемый урон.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Cria três erupções que causam ([98DB51FF]20%[-] de poder de ataque) dano mágico em cada acerto, causa imolação e aumenta o dano recebido.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Tạo ba lần phun lửa gây ra ([98DB51FF]20%[-] Sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương phép mỗi đòn và gây ra Burn và tăng sát thương.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Erzeugt drei Feuerausbrüche, die mit jedem Treffer ([98DB51FF]20 %[-] der Angriffskraft) magischen Schaden zufügen, Brennen verursachen und den erlittenen Schaden erhöhen.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Create three eruption of fire that deals ([98DB51FF]20%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Create three eruption of fire that deals ([98DB51FF]20%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Create three eruption of fire that deals ([98DB51FF]20%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]炎を3ヶ所から噴出させて魔法ダメージ(攻撃力の[98DB51FF]20%[-])を敵に与える＆火傷効果を付与する(被ダメージ量を増やす)'
      - '[DBA32BFF] ทำให้เพลิงปะทุขึ้นมา 3 ครั้ง พร้อมกับสร้างดาเมจเวทมนตร์ ([98DB51FF]20%[-] ของพลังโจมตี) ต่อการโจมตีในแต่ละครั้ง ทำให้ติดสถานะเผาไหม้ และเพิ่มดาเมจที่ได้รับ'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Create three eruption of fire that deals ([98DB51FF]20%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]3번의 분화를 일으켜 각각 마법 데미지를 입히고 (공격력의 [98DB51FF]20%[-]) 화상을 유발합니다. 받는 데미지 상승.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]Create three eruption of fire that deals ([98DB51FF]20%[-] of Attack power) Magical damage each hit and caused Burn and increase Damage Taken.'
      - '[DBA32BFF]制造三次火焰爆发，每次攻击都会造成（[98DB51FF]20%[-] 攻击力）魔法伤害，造成灼伤效果并提高受到的伤害。'
      - '[DBA32BFF]產生三次爆發火焰，可造成每下攻擊的（[98DB51FF]20%[-] 攻擊力）魔法傷害，會產生燃燒效果並提升傷害值。'
