    - Term: PET_75012_SKILL_1_DESC_4
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Ониорис избавляет союзников от всех контролирующих заклятий.\nНа следующие несколько секунд союзники становятся невосприимчивы к любому контролю."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - '[DBA32BFF] Onioris loại bỏ các hiệu ứng khống chế cho đồng minh. Trong vài giây tiếp theo, các đồng minh trở nên miễn nhiễm với các hiệu ứng khống chế.'
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - '[DBA32BFF]オニノリスが味方にかかっている行動妨害効果を打ち消す。その後数秒間、味方は行動妨害効果に耐性を持つ'
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - '[DBA32BFF]오니오리스가 군중 제어에 걸린 모든 아군들을 정화합니다. 다음 몇 초 동안, 아군들은 군중 제어에 면역이 됩니다.'
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris cleanses allies of all crowd control.\nFor the next few seconds, allies become immune to crowd controls."
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
