    - Term: PET_75012_SKILL_2_DESC_5
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Ониорис призывает сферы энергии света, которые вращаются вокруг него и взрываются при контакте с врагом.\nВзрываясь, сферы наносят магический урон ([98DB51FF]150%[-] силы атаки) всем окружающим врагам и увеличивают получаемый ими урон."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - '[DBA32BFF] Onioris triệu hồi các quả cầu ánh sáng bay xung quanh mình, quả cầu sẽ phát nổ khi va chạm với mục tiêu gây ([98DB51FF]150%[-] sức mạnh tấn công) Sát thương phép và tăng Sát Thương nhận vào cho tất cả kẻ địch xung quanh.'
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]オニノリスが周囲を取り囲む光のエネルギーオーブを召喚する。このオーブは敵に当たると爆発する。\nオーブが爆発すると、近くにいる敵に魔法ダメージ(攻撃力の[98DB51FF]150%[-])を与え、さらに被ダメージ量を増やす効果も与える"
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
      - '[DBA32BFF]오니오리스가 주변을 도는 빛 에너지의 구슬을 소환하며 구슬은 적에 닿는 순간 폭발합니다. 구슬이 폭발하면 주변의 모든 적들에게 (공격력의 [98DB51FF]150%[-]) 마법 대미지를 입히고 적이 받는 대미지를 증가시킵니다.'
      - "[DBA32BFF]Onioris summons orbs of light energy which orbit around it, exploding upon contacting an enemy.\nWhen exploding orbs deal ([98DB51FF]150%[-] of Attack power) Magical Damage and increase Damage Taken to all nearby enemies."
