    - Term: QUINN_REQUEST_EVENT_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Thể lệ sự kiện:\n- Hoàn thành các nhiệm vụ Quinn đưa ra để nhận tiền xu sự kiện\n- Nhiệm vụ sẽ được làm mới mỗi ngày\n- Quà sẽ không được đổi khi sự kiện kết thúc \n- Hoàn thành nhiệm vụ sẽ tự động nhận được tiền xu sự kiện"
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Etapa del evento:\n- Completa las misiones que te solicita Quinn para recibir monedas del evento.\n- Las misiones se restablecen cada día.\n- Cuando finaliza el evento, ya no podrás intercambiar regalos.\n- Cuando completas una misión, recibirás las monedas del evento automáticamente."
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "イベントノード:\n- クインが求めるクエストをクリアでイベントコインを獲得できる\n- ミッションは毎日リセットされる\n-イベント期間終了後はもうギフトを交換できなくなるので注意\n- クエストをクリア後、コインは自動的に受け取ることができる"
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Nodus Acara:\n- Selesaikan misi yang dibutuhkan Quinn untuk menerima Koin acara.\n- Misi direset setiap hari.\n- Setelah periode acara berakhir, kamu tidak bisa lagi menukarkan hadiah.\n- Setelah menyelesaikan misi, Koin acara akan diterima secara otomatis."
      - "이벤트 노드 :\n-퀸이 이벤트 코인을 받기 위해 필요한 퀘스트를 완료하세요.\n-미션은 매일 초기화됩니다.\n-이벤트 기간이 종료되면 더 이상 선물을 교환 할 수 없습니다.\n-퀘스트 완료시 이벤트 코인이 자동으로 지급됩니다."
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      - "Event Node:\n- Complete the quests that Quinn requires to receive event Coins.\n- Missions are reset every day.\n- When the event period ends, you will no longer be able to exchange gifts.\n- Upon completing the quest, event Coins will be received automatically."
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
